 [/^Striped bar = a loss\. The downside case loses about TSh ([\d.]+)M in Year 1 \(store level, before head office and tax\)\. The seed sets aside TSh ([\d.]+)M for early losses plus a TSh ([\d.]+)M reserve, so this case is covered with little to spare\. That is why the cost-cut triggers and a pre-agreed bridge sit in the register above\.$/,(m,a,b,c)=>`Nguzo yenye mistari = hasara. Hali mbaya inapoteza takriban TSh milioni ${a} katika mwaka 1 (ngazi ya duka, kabla ya ofisi kuu na kodi). Mtaji wa mwanzo unatenga TSh milioni ${b} kwa hasara za mwanzo pamoja na akiba ya TSh milioni ${c}, kwa hiyo hali hii inafidiwa bila nafasi kubwa ya ziada. Ndiyo sababu vichochezi vya kupunguza gharama na mkopo wa daraja uliokubaliwa mapema viko kwenye rejista hapo juu.`]
