window.AFYA_SWRULES=[].concat([[/^first month with a store profit \(base\)\. Best M(\d+), downside (M\d+|not within year 1)$/,(m,a,b)=>`mwezi wa kwanza wenye faida ya duka (msingi). Bora M${a}, hali mbaya ${b==='not within year 1'?'si ndani ya mwaka 1':b}`]],window.AFYA_SWRULES);
window.AFYA_SWRULES=[].concat([[/^Striped bar = a loss\. The downside case loses about TSh ([\d.]+)M in Year 1 \(store level, before head office and tax\)\. The seed sets aside TSh ([\d.]+)M for early losses plus a TSh ([\d.]+)M reserve, so this case would exhaust them by about TSh ([\d.]+)M\. That is why the cost-cut triggers and a pre-agreed bridge sit in the register above\.$/,(m,a,b,c,d)=>`Nguzo yenye mistari = hasara. Hali mbaya inapoteza takriban TSh milioni ${a} katika mwaka 1 (ngazi ya duka, kabla ya ofisi kuu na kodi). Mtaji wa mwanzo unatenga TSh milioni ${b} kwa hasara za mwanzo pamoja na akiba ya TSh milioni ${c}, kwa hiyo hali hii ingevimaliza kwa takriban TSh milioni ${d}. Ndiyo sababu vichochezi vya kupunguza gharama na mkopo wa daraja uliokubaliwa mapema viko kwenye rejista hapo juu.`]],window.AFYA_SWRULES);

/* v107 4.4/4.5 */
Object.assign(window.AFYA_SWDICT,{"(TSh 340M + TSh 30.1M). At the same pre-money value (TSh 793M, implied by 30% for TSh 340M), the investor would hold about": "(TSh milioni 340 + TSh milioni 30.1). Kwa thamani ileile kabla ya uwekezaji (TSh milioni 793, inayotokana na 30% kwa TSh milioni 340), mwekezaji angemiliki takriban", ", supplies medicines to Afya customers under a written agreement.": ", hutoa dawa kwa wateja wa Afya chini ya makubaliano ya maandishi.", ". A licensed pharmacy near the store supplies them under a written agreement: its pharmacist sells and dispenses, the customer pays the pharmacy directly, and the sealed, labelled pharmacy bag can travel with the member’s box. Afya staff never select, recommend or hand over loose medicines; they pass the request to the partner’s pharmacist. Details in section 4.5.": ". Duka la dawa lenye leseni lililo karibu na duka huzitoa chini ya makubaliano ya maandishi: mfamasia wake huuza na kutoa dawa, mteja hulipa duka la dawa moja kwa moja, na mfuko wa duka la dawa uliofungwa na wenye lebo unaweza kusafirishwa pamoja na boksi la mwanachama. Wafanyakazi wa Afya kamwe hawachagui, hawapendekezi wala hawakabidhi dawa zisizofungashwa; wao hupeleka ombi kwa mfamasia wa mshirika. Maelezo zaidi katika sehemu ya 4.5.", ". Each role is compared with the highest category it could fall under, so the comparison is conservative.": ". Kila nafasi ya kazi inalinganishwa na kundi la juu kabisa ambalo ingeweza kuangukia, hivyo ulinganisho huu ni wa tahadhari.", ". Every employee signs a written contract before the first shift, as the Act requires": ". Kila mfanyakazi husaini mkataba wa maandishi kabla ya zamu yake ya kwanza, kama Sheria inavyotaka", ". The company registers with NSSF and WCF, and PAYE is deducted and paid to TRA every month. Each is a dated task in the compliance calendar (section 4.5).": ". Kampuni inajisajili na NSSF na WCF, na PAYE hukatwa na kulipwa TRA kila mwezi. Kila moja ni jukumu lenye tarehe katika kalenda ya uzingatiaji wa sheria (sehemu ya 4.5).", ". The partner agreement is suspended the day its licence lapses.": ". Makubaliano na mshirika husitishwa siku ileile leseni yake inapokwisha muda.", ". The partner route keeps the flagship’s site choice open and its payroll at 8, while members still receive the medicines their boxes are built around, from a licensed source.": ". Njia ya mshirika inaacha wazi uchaguzi wa eneo la duka kuu na kudumisha orodha ya mishahara kwa watu 8, huku wanachama wakiendelea kupokea dawa ambazo maboksi yao yamejengwa kuzizunguka, kutoka chanzo chenye leseni.", ". The store cannot close for it, so 4 weeks of each role’s hours are bought back from one part-time relief adviser: TSh 7,000,000 × 4 ÷ 52 =": ". Duka haliwezi kufungwa kwa ajili hiyo, hivyo wiki 4 za saa za kila nafasi hununuliwa kutoka kwa mshauri mmoja wa muda wa mbadala wa likizo: TSh 7,000,000 × 4 ÷ 52 =", ". The store is open 84 hours a week (12 hours × 7 days) with two advisers on the floor at all times: 2 × 84 = 168 adviser-hours ÷ 4 advisers =": ". Duka hufunguliwa saa 84 kwa wiki (saa 12 × siku 7) likiwa na washauri wawili sakafuni wakati wote: 2 × 84 = saa 168 za washauri ÷ washauri 4 =", ". The store lead, picker and riders each work 45 hours over five days. The 39 opening hours a week without the store lead are run by a named duty manager, a senior adviser who holds the keys, signs the cash-up and can stop a sale.": ". Kiongozi wa duka, mchukuaji na madereva wa pikipiki kila mmoja hufanya kazi saa 45 kwa siku tano. Saa 39 za ufunguzi kwa wiki zisizo na kiongozi wa duka huendeshwa na meneja wa zamu aliyeteuliwa, mshauri mwandamizi anayeshika funguo, anayesaini hesabu ya fedha za siku na mwenye mamlaka ya kusimamisha mauzo.", ". The store lead, picker and riders follow the same steps: a rider on TSh 600,000 takes home TSh 516,000 (PAYE TSh 24,000).": ". Kiongozi wa duka, mchukuaji na madereva wa pikipiki hufuata hatua zilezile: dereva wa pikipiki mwenye mshahara wa TSh 600,000 hupokea TSh 516,000 (PAYE TSh 24,000).", ". The two late-shift advisers work 20:00 to 21:15 (closing and the cash-up): 1.25 hours × 365 ÷ 12 ≈ 38 hours a month each, at TSh 4,615 an hour (TSh 900,000 ÷ 195 hours) × 5%, about TSh 17,500 for both, or": ". Washauri wawili wa zamu ya jioni hufanya kazi kuanzia 20:00 hadi 21:15 (kufunga duka na hesabu ya fedha za siku): saa 1.25 × 365 ÷ 12 ≈ saa 38 kwa mwezi kila mmoja, kwa TSh 4,615 kwa saa (TSh 900,000 ÷ saa 195) × 5%, takriban TSh 17,500 kwa wote wawili, au", "1 part-time": "1 wa muda", "10 · Compliance · employment law and the workplace": "10 · Uzingatiaji · sheria ya ajira na mahali pa kazi", "28 days’ paid annual leave; sick leave of 126 days in a three-year cycle, the first 63 on full pay; maternity leave of 84 days (100 for multiple births); paternity leave of 3 days; 28 days’ notice after the first month": "Likizo ya mwaka yenye malipo ya siku 28; likizo ya ugonjwa ya siku 126 katika mzunguko wa miaka mitatu, siku 63 za kwanza kwa mshahara kamili; likizo ya uzazi ya siku 84 (100 kwa watoto zaidi ya mmoja); likizo ya uzazi kwa baba ya siku 3; notisi ya siku 28 baada ya mwezi wa kwanza", "325 unique sources": "Vyanzo 325 vya kipekee", "42 hours each": "saa 42 kila mmoja", "; PAYE bands": "; viwango vya PAYE", "; the Government gave unregistered workplaces 90 days from January 2026 to comply": "; Serikali ilitoa kwa maeneo ya kazi yasiyosajiliwa siku 90 kuanzia Januari 2026 kutimiza masharti", "A health adviser on TSh 900,000": "Mshauri wa afya mwenye mshahara wa TSh 900,000", "A licensed partner pharmacy": "Duka la dawa mshirika lenye leseni", "A medicine is sold or handled by Afya instead of the partner pharmacy": "Dawa inauzwa au kushughulikiwa na Afya badala ya duka la dawa mshirika", "A medicine question reaches an adviser who is not licensed to answer it.": "Swali kuhusu dawa linamfikia mshauri asiye na leseni ya kulijibu.", "A member adds “medicines from the pharmacy” in the app, or tells an adviser, who passes it on. Afya staff never choose or recommend the medicine.": "Mwanachama huongeza “dawa kutoka duka la dawa” kwenye programu, au humwambia mshauri, ambaye huwasilisha ombi hilo. Wafanyakazi wa Afya kamwe hawachagui wala hawapendekezi dawa.", "Advisers are trained to stop and hand over: the request goes to the partner pharmacy’s pharmacist through the app, and the customer is called back. Every hand-over is logged, so the founders can audit that no medicine advice was given by Afya staff.": "Washauri wamefunzwa kusita na kukabidhi: ombi hupelekwa kwa mfamasia wa duka la dawa mshirika kupitia programu, na mteja hupigiwa simu baadaye. Kila ukabidhi hurekodiwa, hivyo waanzilishi wanaweza kukagua kwamba hakuna ushauri wa dawa uliotolewa na wafanyakazi wa Afya.", "Afya Basics sells devices, diagnostics, first aid, hygiene, mother & baby, mobility and cosmetics. It does not sell, dispense or take payment for any medicine. A licensed retail pharmacy near the store, registered with the Pharmacy Council and run by a pharmacist in charge": "Afya Basics huuza vifaa tiba, vifaa vya vipimo, huduma ya kwanza, bidhaa za usafi, bidhaa za mama na mtoto, vifaa vya kusaidia kutembea na vipodozi. Haiuzi, haitoi wala haipokei malipo ya dawa yoyote. Duka la rejareja la dawa lenye leseni lililo karibu na duka, lililosajiliwa na Baraza la Famasi na kuendeshwa na mfamasia mkuu", "Afya Check readings explained": "Maelezo ya vipimo vya Afya Check", "Afya Check · floor": "Afya Check · sakafu ya duka", "Afya policy · 7-day swap": "Sera ya Afya · kubadilisha ndani ya siku 7", "Afya staff handheld": "Kifaa cha mkononi cha wafanyakazi wa Afya", "Agreement suspended if either lapses": "Makubaliano husitishwa iwapo chochote kati ya hivi kitakwisha muda", "Any medicine appears in the Afya catalogue or on an Afya receipt": "Dawa yoyote inaonekana kwenye katalogi ya Afya au kwenye risiti ya Afya", "Compliance without a second licence or a pharmacist on the payroll": "Uzingatiaji wa sheria bila leseni ya pili wala mfamasia kwenye orodha ya mishahara", "Cost to Afya Basics": "Gharama kwa Afya Basics", "Customer details are shared only with consent, under the PDPA.": "Taarifa za mteja hushirikishwa kwa ridhaa yake tu, chini ya PDPA.", "Data.": "Taarifa.", "Decision taken · November 2026": "Uamuzi uliofanywa · Novemba 2026", "Delivery.": "Usafirishaji.", "Employee NSSF 10% (deducted)": "NSSF ya mfanyakazi 10% (hukatwa)", "Employer NSSF 10% + WCF 0.5% (paid on top)": "NSSF ya mwajiri 10% + WCF 0.5% (hulipwa juu ya mshahara)", "Employer NSSF 10% and WCF 0.5%": "NSSF ya mwajiri 10% na WCF 0.5%", "Every employee completes a first-aid certificate in week 4 of training, so a trained first aider is on duty whenever the doors are open. A stocked first-aid box, fire extinguishers and marked exits are on the opening checklist; riders have helmets, reflective jackets and road-safety training; the picker uses a lifting aid for cartons over 20 kg.": "Kila mfanyakazi hukamilisha cheti cha huduma ya kwanza katika wiki ya 4 ya mafunzo, hivyo mtoa huduma ya kwanza aliyefunzwa huwa kazini wakati wote milango ikiwa wazi. Sanduku la huduma ya kwanza lenye vifaa kamili, vizima moto na njia za kutokea zenye alama ni sehemu ya orodha ya ukaguzi wa ufunguzi; madereva wa pikipiki wana kofia ngumu, jaketi zinazoakisi mwanga na mafunzo ya usalama barabarani; mchukuaji hutumia kifaa cha kusaidia kunyanyua katoni zenye uzito unaozidi 20 kg.", "Every employee is entitled to 28 days’ paid annual leave": "Kila mfanyakazi ana haki ya likizo ya mwaka yenye malipo ya siku 28", "Exclusivity.": "Upekee.", "Five steps, two businesses, one delivery": "Hatua tano, biashara mbili, usafirishaji mmoja", "Founders + regulatory lawyer · M−3 · Permit": "Waanzilishi + mwanasheria wa masuala ya udhibiti · M−3 · Kibali", "Gross salary": "Mshahara ghafi", "Health and safety in the store": "Afya na usalama dukani", "How one order works": "Jinsi oda moja inavyoshughulikiwa", "Labour law is a cost and a promise: every rule below is built into the rota, the payroll and the People module, so the store is compliant on the first day rather than after the first inspection.": "Sheria ya kazi ni gharama na pia ni ahadi: kila kanuni iliyo hapa chini imejengwa ndani ya ratiba ya zamu, orodha ya mishahara na moduli ya Watu, hivyo duka linazingatia sheria tangu siku ya kwanza badala ya baada ya ukaguzi wa kwanza.", "Leave and family rights": "Likizo na haki za familia", "Leave cover and night work, calculated": "Mbadala wa likizo na kazi ya usiku, kwa hesabu", "Leave cover.": "Mbadala wa likizo.", "Legal minimum (sector)": "Kiwango cha chini kisheria (sekta)", "Licences.": "Leseni.", "Line": "Kipengele", "Medical device": "Kifaa tiba", "Medical devices": "Vifaa tiba", "Medicines through a licensed partner pharmacy": "Dawa kupitia duka la dawa mshirika lenye leseni", "Minimum wages from the 2025 Wage Order, in force since 1 January 2026": "Kima cha chini cha mshahara kwa mujibu wa Amri ya Mishahara ya 2025, inayotumika tangu 1 Januari 2026", "Monthly pay from the master model, built up line by line. Each salary is set well above the legal minimum for its sector; the employer adds its share of social security and workers’ compensation; and two further costs required by labour law, cover for annual leave and the night-work premium, are now in the model.": "Mshahara wa kila mwezi kutoka modeli kuu, uliojengwa kipengele kwa kipengele. Kila mshahara umewekwa juu kwa kiasi kikubwa kuliko kima cha chini cha mshahara cha sekta yake; mwajiri huongeza sehemu yake ya hifadhi ya jamii na fidia kwa wafanyakazi; na gharama mbili za ziada zinazotakiwa na sheria ya kazi, yaani mbadala wa likizo ya mwaka na nyongeza ya kazi ya usiku, sasa zimejumuishwa kwenye modeli.", "Multiple": "Mbalimbali", "NSSF is 20% of pay, split equally between employer and employee": "NSSF ni 20% ya mshahara, ikigawanywa sawa kati ya mwajiri na mfanyakazi", "Night work.": "Kazi ya usiku.", "Night-work premium": "Nyongeza ya kazi ya usiku", "No one works more than 45 ordinary hours": "Hakuna anayefanya kazi zaidi ya saa 45 za kawaida", "None: the customer may use any pharmacy.": "Hakuna: mteja anaweza kutumia duka lolote la dawa.", "OSHA, NSSF, WCF and TRA": "OSHA, NSSF, WCF na TRA", "Opening its own pharmacy counter would require Afya to register the premises, employ a pharmacist in charge and, under the licensing guideline, meet location rules such as distance from an existing pharmacy": "Kufungua kaunta yake yenyewe ya dawa kungeilazimu Afya kusajili jengo, kuajiri mfamasia mkuu na, kwa mujibu wa mwongozo wa utoaji leseni, kutimiza masharti ya eneo kama vile umbali kutoka duka la dawa lililopo", "PAYE: TSh 68,000 + 25% of the TSh 50,000 above TSh 760,000": "PAYE: TSh 68,000 + 25% ya TSh 50,000 zinazozidi TSh 760,000", "Partner pharmacy": "Duka la dawa mshirika", "Partner pharmacy agreement signed; its premises permit and pharmacist registration checked": "Makubaliano na duka la dawa mshirika yamesainiwa; kibali chake cha jengo na usajili wa mfamasia vimehakikiwa", "Partner pharmacy sells it": "Duka la dawa mshirika huiuza", "Partner pharmacy · prescription only": "Duka la dawa mshirika · kwa cheti cha daktari pekee", "Partner pharmacy: copy of its renewed premises permit and pharmacist registration on file": "Duka la dawa mshirika: nakala za kibali chake cha jengo kilichohuishwa na usajili wa mfamasia zimehifadhiwa kwenye jalada", "Partner · medicines": "Mshirika · dawa", "Pharmacist.": "Mfamasia.", "Phase 0 steps TSh 7,700,000 · seed-time steps TSh 7,900,000": "Hatua za Awamu ya 0 TSh 7,700,000 · hatua za kipindi cha mtaji wa mwanzo TSh 7,900,000", "Planning estimates · salaries benchmarked against current Dar es Salaam pay before hiring · from the second store the company passes 10 employees and the 3.5% Skills Development Levy is added to the group budget": "Makadirio ya mipango · mishahara italinganishwa na viwango vya sasa vya malipo Dar es Salaam kabla ya kuajiri · kuanzia duka la pili kampuni itazidi wafanyakazi 10 na Tozo ya Kuendeleza Ujuzi ya 3.5% itaongezwa kwenye bajeti ya kampuni kwa ujumla", "Registrations before opening day": "Usajili kabla ya siku ya ufunguzi", "Relief cover for 28 days’ annual leave": "Mbadala wa likizo kwa likizo ya mwaka ya siku 28", "Request.": "Ombi.", "Review.": "Mapitio.", "Rider": "Dereva wa pikipiki", "Sale and payment.": "Mauzo na malipo.", "Sealed bag.": "Mfuko uliofungwa.", "Standards, cosmetics, hygiene": "Viwango, vipodozi, usafi", "TSh 200,500 (trade · business)": "TSh 200,500 (biashara · huduma za kibiashara)", "TSh 240,000 (health · pharmacy)": "TSh 240,000 (afya · famasia)", "TSh 287,500 (postal & courier)": "TSh 287,500 (posta na usafirishaji wa vifurushi)", "Take-home pay": "Mshahara halisi unaopokelewa", "Taxable pay": "Mshahara unaotozwa kodi", "The Act treats work after 20:00 as night work and adds a premium of 5% of basic pay for each hour": "Sheria inahesabu kazi inayofanywa baada ya 20:00 kuwa kazi ya usiku na inaongeza nyongeza ya 5% ya mshahara wa msingi kwa kila saa", "The Afya rider carries the sealed bag with the member’s box and records the handover code; the bag is never opened by Afya staff.": "Dereva wa pikipiki wa Afya hubeba mfuko uliofungwa pamoja na boksi la mwanachama na kurekodi msimbo wa makabidhiano; mfuko haufunguliwi kamwe na wafanyakazi wa Afya.", "The Phase 0 gap (TSh 30.1M) is not funded, and the seed falls short": "Pengo la Awamu ya 0 (TSh milioni 30.1) halijafadhiliwa, na mtaji wa mwanzo haukidhi mahitaji", "The agreement is suspended the same day and a second licensed pharmacy is kept on standby under the same terms. If the courier step is not approved, the customer collects the sealed bag from the pharmacy and Afya delivers only its own products.": "Makubaliano husitishwa siku hiyohiyo, na duka la pili la dawa lenye leseni huwekwa tayari kwa masharti yaleyale. Iwapo hatua ya usafirishaji haitaidhinishwa, mteja huchukua mfuko uliofungwa kutoka duka la dawa na Afya husafirisha bidhaa zake pekee.", "The agreement · what is in it": "Makubaliano · yaliyomo", "The ordinary week is limited to 45 hours, overtime is paid at 1.5 times": "Wiki ya kawaida ina kikomo cha saa 45, saa za ziada hulipwa mara 1.5", "The partner pharmacy loses its licence, or the courier step is ruled out.": "Duka la dawa mshirika linapoteza leseni yake, au hatua ya usafirishaji inakataliwa.", "The partner’s pharmacist calls the customer, checks the prescription where one is needed and confirms the product and dose.": "Mfamasia wa mshirika humpigia mteja simu, hukagua cheti cha daktari pale kinapohitajika na huthibitisha bidhaa na kipimo cha dawa.", "The pharmacy dispenses into a sealed, labelled bag with the customer’s name and its own details.": "Duka la dawa hutoa dawa ndani ya mfuko uliofungwa wenye lebo inayoonyesha jina la mteja na taarifa za duka la dawa lenyewe.", "The pharmacy keeps its premises permit and pharmacist registration current and sends copies each June; the agreement is suspended the day either lapses.": "Duka la dawa huhakikisha kibali chake cha jengo na usajili wa mfamasia viko hai na hutuma nakala kila Juni; makubaliano husitishwa siku yoyote kati ya hivyo inapokwisha muda.", "The pharmacy pays Afya a fixed courier fee per sealed bag delivered (to be agreed; the financial model counts none of it, so it is upside).": "Duka la dawa hulipa Afya ada maalum ya usafirishaji kwa kila mfuko uliofungwa unaowasilishwa (kiasi kitakubaliwa; modeli ya kifedha haihesabu chochote kati yake, hivyo ni faida ya ziada).", "The pharmacy sells it on its own receipt; the customer pays the pharmacy’s own mobile-money number. Afya never handles medicine money.": "Duka la dawa huiuza kwa risiti yake lenyewe; mteja hulipa kwenye namba ya pesa ya simu ya duka la dawa lenyewe. Afya kamwe haishughulikii fedha za dawa.", "The smaller first store (100 m², secondary street) runs with a store lead, 3 health advisers on one long shift (09:00–20:00, 7 days) and a picker and packer. Deliveries go to partner riders paid per order, and a manual check corner replaces the Afya Check kiosk. Employment cost is TSh 5,831,000 a month, including relief cover for annual leave, NSSF and WCF. The rota stays within the 45-hour week: the store lead and 3 advisers give 180 hours a week, enough to keep two people on the floor for all 77 opening hours (154 hours).": "Duka la kwanza lililo dogo zaidi (100 m², barabara ya pili) huendeshwa na kiongozi wa duka, washauri wa afya 3 kwenye zamu moja ndefu (09:00–20:00, siku 7) na mchukuaji na mfungaji. Usafirishaji hufanywa na madereva wa pikipiki washirika wanaolipwa kwa kila oda, na kona ya vipimo vya kawaida inachukua nafasi ya kibanda cha Afya Check. Gharama ya ajira ni TSh 5,831,000 kwa mwezi, ikijumuisha mbadala wa likizo ya mwaka, NSSF na WCF. Ratiba ya zamu inabaki ndani ya wiki ya saa 45: kiongozi wa duka na washauri 3 hutoa saa 180 kwa wiki, zinazotosha kuweka watu wawili sakafuni kwa saa zote 77 za ufunguzi (saa 154).", "The workplace is registered with OSHA before trading starts, inspected, and issued a compliance licence renewed every year with an annual electrical inspection": "Mahali pa kazi husajiliwa na OSHA kabla ya kuanza biashara, hukaguliwa, na hupewa leseni ya uzingatiaji wa sheria inayohuishwa kila mwaka pamoja na ukaguzi wa mfumo wa umeme wa kila mwaka", "Trained first aiders on every shift": "Watoa huduma ya kwanza waliofunzwa kwenye kila zamu", "Where the two new lines come from": "Vipengele viwili vipya vinatoka wapi", "Why this route": "Kwa nini njia hii", "Worked example · one payslip": "Mfano wa hesabu · hati moja ya mshahara", "Working hours · the rota is checked against the law": "Saa za kazi · ratiba ya zamu inakaguliwa dhidi ya sheria", "Written into every contract": "Imeandikwa katika kila mkataba", "Written, priced, audited": "Imeandikwa, imepangiwa gharama, imekaguliwa", "Zoning, and a licensed partner pharmacy within reach of the store": "Mpango wa matumizi ya ardhi, na duka la dawa mshirika lenye leseni lililo karibu na duka", "a month before employer contributions. Rider leave is covered by partner riders paid per order. One part-time contract keeps the payroll at 9 people, below the 10 at which the 3.5% Skills Development Levy starts": "kwa mwezi kabla ya michango ya mwajiri. Likizo ya madereva wa pikipiki hufidiwa na madereva wa pikipiki washirika wanaolipwa kwa kila oda. Mkataba mmoja wa muda unadumisha orodha ya mishahara kwa watu 9, chini ya kiwango cha 10 ambapo Tozo ya Kuendeleza Ujuzi ya 3.5% huanza kutozwa", "employment cost per month, everything included": "gharama ya ajira kwa mwezi, kila kitu kikijumuishwa", "licensed · under contract": "lenye leseni · chini ya mkataba", "with NSSF and WCF.": "na NSSF na WCF.", "· 4 weeks of every role’s hours a year": "· wiki 4 za saa za kila nafasi kwa mwaka", "· late shift 20:00–21:15": "· zamu ya jioni 20:00–21:15", "· on salaries and relief pay": "· kwenye mishahara na malipo ya mbadala wa likizo"});
Object.assign(window.AFYA_SWDICT,{"Afya pay":"Mshahara wa Afya"});

/* v108 4.4/4.5 rebuild */
Object.assign(window.AFYA_SWDICT,{"+TSh 30.15M for Phase 0": "+TSh milioni 30.15 kwa Awamu ya 0", ", and the holder then pays a yearly retention fee of USD 200 per registered device or USD 50 per notified Class A device": ", na mmiliki kisha hulipa ada ya kila mwaka ya kudumisha usajili ya USD 200 kwa kila kifaa kilichosajiliwa au USD 50 kwa kila kifaa cha Daraja A kilichotolewa taarifa", "0.5 month × TSh 1,200,000 × 1.105": "mwezi 0.5 × TSh 1,200,000 × 1.105", "0.75 month × TSh 3,600,000 × 1.105": "mwezi 0.75 × TSh 3,600,000 × 1.105", "0.75 month × TSh 700,000 × 1.105": "mwezi 0.75 × TSh 700,000 × 1.105", "02 · At a glance · quality in six numbers": "02 · Kwa muhtasari · ubora katika takwimu sita", "02 · At a glance · the team in six numbers": "02 · Kwa muhtasari · timu katika takwimu sita", "05 · Accountability · what each role answers for": "05 · Uwajibikaji · kila nafasi inawajibika kwa nini", "06 · The quality system · how the standard is kept every day": "06 · Mfumo wa ubora · jinsi kiwango kinavyodumishwa kila siku", "07 · Hiring plan · from three months before opening to day one": "07 · Mpango wa kuajiri · kuanzia miezi mitatu kabla ya ufunguzi hadi siku ya kwanza", "1 · Supplier approval": "1 · Uidhinishaji wa msambazaji", "11 · Controls · cash, mobile money and stock": "11 · Udhibiti · fedha taslimu, pesa za simu na bidhaa", "11 · The numbers · what compliance costs": "11 · Takwimu · gharama ya uzingatiaji wa sheria", "15 · Performance and career · keeping good people": "15 · Utendaji na maendeleo ya kikazi · kuwabakiza watu bora", "2 months × TSh 1,500,000 × 1.105 (NSSF + WCF)": "miezi 2 × TSh 1,500,000 × 1.105 (NSSF + WCF)", "2 riders": "madereva wa pikipiki 2", "2 weeks before opening": "wiki 2 kabla ya ufunguzi", "2 · Goods received": "2 · Upokeaji wa bidhaa", "3 weeks before opening": "wiki 3 kabla ya ufunguzi", "3 · Storage": "3 · Uhifadhi", "4 health advisers": "washauri wa afya 4", "4 weeks": "wiki 4", "4 · On the shelf": "4 · Kwenye rafu", "5 people for TSh 4.5M": "watu 5 kwa TSh milioni 4.5", "5 · At the till": "5 · Kwenye kaunta ya malipo", "6 · After the sale": "6 · Baada ya mauzo", "7 days": "siku 7", "7 · Monthly review": "7 · Mapitio ya kila mwezi", "8 people × 2 sets × TSh 45,000": "watu 8 × seti 2 × TSh 45,000", "8 people × TSh 60,000": "watu 8 × TSh 60,000", "95% delivered in the promised wave; 100% of handovers confirmed with code and photo; zero road incidents": "95% husafirishwa ndani ya mzunguko ulioahidiwa; 100% ya makabidhiano huthibitishwa kwa msimbo na picha; sifuri ajali za barabarani", "99.5% of lines correct; 100% of boxes photographed; collect orders ready within 2 hours; every delivery checked for batch and expiry": "99.5% ya vipengele sahihi; 100% ya maboksi hupigwa picha; oda za kuchukua dukani huwa tayari ndani ya saa 2; kila usafirishaji hukaguliwa bechi na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi", "A 20-minute one-to-one with the store lead every month; a quarterly scorecard built from the targets above; a yearly review with both founders that sets pay for the next year. Feedback is recorded in the People module so it survives a change of store lead.": "Kikao cha ana kwa ana cha dakika 20 na kiongozi wa duka kila mwezi; kadi ya matokeo ya kila robo mwaka inayotokana na malengo yaliyo hapo juu; mapitio ya kila mwaka pamoja na waanzilishi wote wawili yanayopanga mshahara wa mwaka unaofuata. Mrejesho hurekodiwa kwenye moduli ya Watu ili udumu hata kiongozi wa duka akibadilika.", "A path to lead": "Njia ya kuwa kiongozi", "A role is only clear when its owner knows what is measured. Each target below is read from the system, not from a manager’s impression, and is reviewed on the monthly scorecard.": "Nafasi ya kazi huwa wazi pale tu mhusika anapojua kinachopimwa. Kila lengo lililo hapa chini husomwa kutoka kwenye mfumo, si kutokana na maoni ya meneja, na hupitiwa kwenye kadi ya matokeo ya kila mwezi.", "Access and evidence": "Ufikiaji na ushahidi", "Accountable for": "Anawajibika kwa", "Advertising, interviews and reference checks": "Matangazo, usaili na uhakiki wa wadhamini", "Advisers are recognised for members still active after three months and for red readings followed up, never for the size of a single sale. This protects customers from pressure selling and keeps the team’s incentives aligned with the membership model.": "Washauri hutambuliwa kwa wanachama wanaoendelea kuwa hai baada ya miezi mitatu na kwa vipimo vyekundu vinavyofuatiliwa, kamwe si kwa ukubwa wa mauzo ya mara moja. Hili huwalinda wateja dhidi ya ushawishi wa kununua kwa shinikizo na hufanya motisha za timu ziendane na mtindo wa uanachama.", "Advisers explain a blood-pressure reading to a role-play customer; pickers pick a 10-line order against the clock; riders complete a route test.": "Washauri humweleza mteja wa kuigiza kipimo cha shinikizo la damu; wachukuaji hukusanya oda ya vipengele 10 kwa muda uliopimwa; madereva wa pikipiki hukamilisha jaribio la njia.", "Afya Basics · Investor pack": "Afya Basics · Kifurushi cha Mwekezaji", "Afya Boxes, online orders, click-and-collect and goods received": "Afya Box, oda za mtandaoni, kuagiza na kuchukua dukani, na upokeaji wa bidhaa", "Approved-supplier list": "Orodha ya wasambazaji walioidhinishwa", "Authority": "Mamlaka", "Blocked-sale log": "Kumbukumbu ya mauzo yaliyozuiwa", "Business licence": "Leseni ya biashara", "Buy brands that are already registered": "Kununua chapa ambazo tayari zimesajiliwa", "Calculation": "Hesabu", "Complaints acknowledged within 5 minutes in opening hours": "Malalamiko hupokelewa na kujibiwa ndani ya dakika 5 katika saa za kazi", "Complaints and recall log": "Kumbukumbu ya malalamiko na urejeshaji wa bidhaa", "Complaints closed with the customer’s agreement within 5 days": "Malalamiko hufungwa kwa ridhaa ya mteja ndani ya siku 5", "Compliance is not a folder of licences; it is a set of checks that run whether or not anyone is watching. Afya Basics runs a written quality system with an owner for each step, a record for each check and a monthly review of the results.": "Uzingatiaji wa sheria si jalada la leseni; ni mfululizo wa ukaguzi unaofanyika iwe kuna anayeangalia au la. Afya Basics huendesha mfumo wa ubora ulioandikwa wenye mhusika kwa kila hatua, kumbukumbu kwa kila ukaguzi na mapitio ya matokeo kila mwezi.", "Concept image · every box photographed before sealing": "Picha ya dhana · kila boksi hupigwa picha kabla ya kufungwa", "Concept image · the Afya Check kiosk, the adviser’s main station": "Picha ya dhana · kibanda cha Afya Check, kituo kikuu cha mshauri", "Concept image · the counter the store lead runs": "Picha ya dhana · kaunta inayoendeshwa na kiongozi wa duka", "Cost": "Gharama", "Counted in small pieces, all the time": "Huhesabiwa kwa sehemu ndogo, wakati wote", "Daily walk checklist": "Orodha ya ukaguzi wa kila siku dukani", "Data-protection registration, small business": "Usajili wa ulinzi wa taarifa binafsi, biashara ndogo", "Dealer’s permit for medical devices, retail": "Kibali cha muuzaji wa vifaa tiba, rejareja", "Deliveries checked for batch and expiry at receipt": "Bidhaa zinazowasili hukaguliwa bechi na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi wakati wa kupokelewa", "Each employee logs in with their own PIN, so every sale, refund, count and checklist tick carries a name and a time. Cameras cover the till, the stockroom and the door, with recordings kept for 30 days. Keys and alarm codes change when anyone with access leaves.": "Kila mfanyakazi huingia kwenye mfumo kwa PIN yake mwenyewe, hivyo kila mauzo, marejesho ya fedha, hesabu ya bidhaa na alama ya orodha ya ukaguzi hubeba jina na muda. Kamera hufunika kaunta ya malipo, stoo na mlango, na rekodi huhifadhiwa kwa siku 30. Funguo na namba za siri za king’ora hubadilishwa pale mtu yeyote mwenye ufikiaji anapoondoka.", "Every M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, HaloPesa and card payment is matched to its sale by the system. A payment with no sale, or a sale with no payment, is listed as an exception. Refunds and price changes need the store lead’s PIN, so no single person can both sell and refund.": "Kila malipo ya M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, HaloPesa na kadi huoanishwa na mauzo yake na mfumo. Malipo yasiyo na mauzo, au mauzo yasiyo na malipo, huorodheshwa kama hitilafu. Marejesho ya fedha na mabadiliko ya bei yanahitaji PIN ya kiongozi wa duka, hivyo hakuna mtu mmoja anayeweza kuuza na pia kurejesha fedha.", "Every delivery is checked against the purchase order by two people for quantity, batch and expiry. A fifth of all products is counted each week, so the whole range is counted every five weeks; high-value devices are counted monthly; the full store is counted every quarter. Target: system stock matches the shelf for at least 98% of lines.": "Kila mzigo unaowasili hukaguliwa dhidi ya oda ya ununuzi na watu wawili kwa idadi, bechi na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi. Sehemu moja ya tano ya bidhaa zote huhesabiwa kila wiki, hivyo bidhaa zote huhesabiwa kila baada ya wiki tano; vifaa vya thamani kubwa huhesabiwa kila mwezi; duka zima huhesabiwa kila robo mwaka. Lengo: bidhaa kwenye mfumo zilingane na zilizo kwenye rafu kwa angalau 98% ya vipengele.", "Every licence and registration has a fee. The known fees are small next to the TSh 6M a year (TSh 500,000 a month) the master model sets aside for insurance and licences; the rest of that budget covers insurance and the fees that are confirmed at inspection.": "Kila leseni na usajili una ada. Ada zinazojulikana ni ndogo ukilinganisha na TSh milioni 6 kwa mwaka (TSh 500,000 kwa mwezi) ambazo modeli kuu imetenga kwa bima na leseni; sehemu iliyobaki ya bajeti hiyo inagharamia bima na ada zinazothibitishwa wakati wa ukaguzi.", "Every year": "Kila mwaka", "Every year, by 30 June": "Kila mwaka, kabla ya 30 Juni", "Expired or recalled units sold": "Bidhaa zilizokwisha muda au zilizorejeshwa zilizouzwa", "Fair, and stated openly": "Haki, na kutangazwa wazi", "Fire and Rescue Force": "Jeshi la Zimamoto na Uokoaji", "Fire safety certificate": "Cheti cha usalama dhidi ya moto", "First-aid certificates": "Vyeti vya huduma ya kwanza", "First-expiry-first-out; price label matches the system; damaged packs removed": "Kinachoisha muda kwanza hutoka kwanza; lebo ya bei inalingana na mfumo; pakiti zilizoharibika huondolewa", "Four steps, the same for every role": "Hatua nne, zilezile kwa kila nafasi", "From adviser to store lead in two years": "Kutoka mshauri hadi kiongozi wa duka ndani ya miaka miwili", "Goods-received note with photos": "Hati ya kupokea bidhaa yenye picha", "Health adviser → senior adviser and duty manager (named in year 1) → store lead of the second store (year 2, when the second store and packing hub open) → area lead at four stores (year 3). Every promotion is filled from inside first, so each new store opens with a lead who already knows the system.": "Mshauri wa afya → mshauri mwandamizi na meneja wa zamu (anateuliwa mwaka wa 1) → kiongozi wa duka la pili (mwaka wa 2, duka la pili na kituo cha kufungashia vinapofunguliwa) → kiongozi wa eneo kwa maduka manne (mwaka wa 3). Kila nafasi ya kupandishwa cheo hujazwa kwanza kutoka ndani, hivyo kila duka jipya hufunguliwa likiwa na kiongozi anayeujua mfumo tayari.", "How often": "Mara ngapi", "How people are chosen": "Jinsi watu wanavyochaguliwa", "Interview with both founders.": "Usaili na waanzilishi wote wawili.", "Item": "Kipengele", "Job boards, WhatsApp groups, university career offices": "Tovuti za ajira, makundi ya WhatsApp, ofisi za ajira za vyuo vikuu", "Licence every year": "Leseni kila mwaka", "Licence, registration of each product, sample check, references (the six supplier gates in section 4.2)": "Leseni, usajili wa kila bidhaa, ukaguzi wa sampuli, wadhamini (vigezo sita vya msambazaji katika sehemu ya 4.2)", "Live from the master model · base case ·": "Moja kwa moja kutoka modeli kuu · hali ya msingi ·", "Matched automatically": "Huoanishwa kiotomatiki", "Measured on care, not sales": "Hupimwa kwa huduma, si kwa mauzo", "Members still active after three months; WhatsApp reply time; Afya Checks completed": "Wanachama wanaoendelea kuwa hai baada ya miezi mitatu; muda wa kujibu WhatsApp; vipimo vya Afya Check vilivyokamilika", "Mobile money and cards": "Pesa za simu na kadi", "Monthly churn at or below the model’s 8%; replies within 5 minutes in opening hours; every red reading referred and followed up within 3 days": "Kiwango cha wanachama wanaoondoka kwa mwezi kisichozidi 8% ya modeli; majibu ndani ya dakika 5 katika saa za kazi; kila kipimo chekundu hupelekwa kwa rufaa na kufuatiliwa ndani ya siku 3", "Monthly, quarterly, yearly": "Kila mwezi, kila robo mwaka, kila mwaka", "Most retail losses come from three places: the till, the payment screen and the stockroom. Each has a control that runs every day, and every exception appears in the 21:00 report the founders read.": "Hasara nyingi za rejareja hutoka sehemu tatu: kaunta ya malipo, skrini ya malipo na stoo. Kila moja ina udhibiti unaofanyika kila siku, na kila hitilafu huonekana kwenye ripoti ya saa 21:00 inayosomwa na waanzilishi.", "Municipal council or ministry": "Halmashauri ya manispaa au wizara", "None for Afya at launch": "Hakuna kwa Afya wakati wa kuanza", "On-time by wave; coded handovers; road safety": "Kwa wakati kwa kila mzunguko; makabidhiano kwa msimbo; usalama barabarani", "People are hired in the order the store needs them, and paid from the day they start. The seed line “Pre-opening team: hiring & training” is now calculated from this plan instead of being a round figure: it rises from TSh 8M to TSh 9M, and the reserve falls by TSh 1M, so the TSh 340M total does not change.": "Watu huajiriwa kwa mpangilio ambao duka linawahitaji, na hulipwa kuanzia siku wanayoanza. Kipengele cha mtaji wa mwanzo “Timu ya kabla ya ufunguzi: kuajiri na mafunzo” sasa kinakokotolewa kutoka mpango huu badala ya kuwa kiasi cha kukadiria: kinapanda kutoka TSh milioni 8 hadi TSh milioni 9, na akiba inashuka kwa TSh milioni 1, hivyo jumla ya TSh milioni 340 haibadiliki.", "Pick accuracy; boxes photographed; collect-ready time; receiving checks": "Usahihi wa ukusanyaji; maboksi yaliyopigwa picha; muda wa oda kuwa tayari kuchukuliwa; ukaguzi wa upokeaji", "Picker + second person": "Mchukuaji + mtu wa pili", "Practical test.": "Jaribio la vitendo.", "Product registration": "Usajili wa bidhaa", "Qualifications checked against the role: a registered physiotherapy or nursing diploma for the store lead; a health-related certificate or diploma, or retail experience with strong Kiswahili and English, for advisers; a valid licence and two years’ riding for riders.": "Sifa hukaguliwa kulingana na nafasi: stashahada iliyosajiliwa ya fiziotherapia au uuguzi kwa kiongozi wa duka; cheti au stashahada inayohusiana na afya, au uzoefu wa rejareja pamoja na umahiri wa Kiswahili na Kiingereza, kwa washauri; leseni halali na uzoefu wa miaka miwili wa kuendesha pikipiki kwa madereva wa pikipiki.", "Quality scorecard": "Kadi ya matokeo ya ubora", "Quarterly mock recall: every affected customer listed": "Zoezi la kurejesha bidhaa kila robo mwaka: kila mteja aliyeathirika huorodheshwa", "Recognition": "Utambuzi", "Record": "Kumbukumbu", "References and documents.": "Wadhamini na nyaraka.", "Replacing a trained adviser costs roughly a month of their salary in recruitment and training time (planning estimate), and members notice the change. Retention is therefore planned, not hoped for.": "Kumbadilisha mshauri aliyefunzwa kunagharimu takriban mshahara wake wa mwezi mmoja katika muda wa kuajiri na kufundisha (makadirio ya mipango), na wanachama huhisi mabadiliko hayo. Kwa hiyo, kuwabakiza wafanyakazi kunapangwa, hakutegemewi kwa matumaini tu.", "Reviews": "Mapitio", "Room and stockroom kept at 15–25 °C and below 65% humidity, the range most test strips and devices are labelled for; readings logged every 15 minutes with an alarm": "Chumba cha duka na stoo hudumishwa kwenye 15–25 °C na unyevu chini ya 65%, kiwango ambacho vipande vingi vya vipimo na vifaa vimeandikiwa kwenye lebo; vipimo hurekodiwa kila dakika 15 pamoja na king’ora cha tahadhari", "Salaries and on-costs from the master model · uniform, first-aid course and advertising prices are planning estimates to be confirmed with suppliers": "Mishahara na gharama zinazoambatana nayo kutoka modeli kuu · bei za sare, kozi ya huduma ya kwanza na matangazo ni makadirio ya mipango yatakayothibitishwa na wasambazaji", "Same-day and monthly deliveries, handover and the bike": "Usafirishaji wa siku hiyohiyo na wa kila mwezi, makabidhiano na pikipiki", "Same-day delivery across Dar es Salaam for orders placed before 15:00, and every Afya Box to the door. The remaining lines cover launch marketing (TSh 7M), the pre-opening team (TSh 9M), operating losses until break-even (TSh 119M) and the working-capital reserve (TSh 41M).": "Usafirishaji wa siku hiyohiyo kote Dar es Salaam kwa oda zinazowekwa kabla ya 15:00, na kila Afya Box hadi mlangoni. Vipengele vilivyobaki vinagharamia masoko ya uzinduzi (TSh milioni 7), timu ya kabla ya ufunguzi (TSh milioni 9), hasara za uendeshaji hadi kufikia kiwango cha kurudisha gharama (TSh milioni 119) na akiba ya mtaji wa uendeshaji (TSh milioni 41).", "Screen.": "Uchujaji.", "Section 6.1 derives cash month by month from the model: tranches 1 and 2 (TSh 255M) against a build spend of TSh 180M before opening, then monthly profit, later lease advances and tranche 3. The ask, tranche shape and reserve will be confirmed together with the Phase 0 decision.": "Sehemu ya 6.1 inakokotoa fedha taslimu mwezi kwa mwezi kutoka modeli: awamu ya 1 na ya 2 (TSh milioni 255) dhidi ya matumizi ya ujenzi ya TSh milioni 180 kabla ya ufunguzi, kisha faida ya kila mwezi, malipo ya awali ya kodi ya pango ya baadaye na awamu ya 3. Kiasi kinachoombwa, mgawanyo wa awamu na akiba vitathibitishwa pamoja na uamuzi wa Awamu ya 0.", "Set at inspection": "Huwekwa wakati wa ukaguzi", "Set by business line": "Huwekwa kulingana na aina ya biashara", "Signed monthly report": "Ripoti ya kila mwezi iliyosainiwa", "Start small option": "Chaguo la kuanza kidogo", "Starts": "Anaanza", "Step": "Hatua", "Stock": "Bidhaa", "Store profit against the model; SOP ticks on time; complaints closed; inspection findings": "Faida ya duka dhidi ya modeli; alama za SOP kwa wakati; malalamiko yaliyofungwa; matokeo ya ukaguzi", "TSh 100,000; renewal TSh 50,000": "TSh 100,000; kuhuisha TSh 50,000", "Target": "Lengo", "Targets and frequencies are Afya policy, set before opening and audited monthly by the outsourced accountant": "Malengo na marudio ni sera ya Afya, yaliyowekwa kabla ya ufunguzi na kukaguliwa kila mwezi na mhasibu wa nje", "Targets are Afya policy · storage range set from typical manufacturer labelling and confirmed product by product": "Malengo ni sera ya Afya · kiwango cha uhifadhi kimewekwa kutokana na lebo za kawaida za watengenezaji na kuthibitishwa bidhaa kwa bidhaa", "Targets are Afya policy · the 8% churn is the master model’s planning assumption (section 6.1)": "Malengo ni sera ya Afya · kiwango cha 8% cha wanachama wanaoondoka ni dhana ya mipango ya modeli kuu (sehemu ya 6.1)", "Technology: POS, app, manual check corner": "Teknolojia: POS, programu, kona ya vipimo vya kawaida", "Temperature and humidity log": "Kumbukumbu ya joto na unyevu", "Temperature or humidity readings outside range not reviewed within 24 hours": "Vipimo vya joto au unyevu vilivyo nje ya kiwango ambavyo havijapitiwa ndani ya saa 24", "The 100 m² store hires its store lead one month before opening (TSh 1,657,500), three advisers and the picker two weeks before (TSh 1,491,750 and TSh 386,750), with uniforms (TSh 450,000), first-aid certificates (TSh 300,000) and advertising (TSh 200,000): TSh 4,486,000 in total. Its seed line rises from TSh 4M to TSh 4.5M and its reserve falls by TSh 0.5M, so the TSh 150M total is unchanged.": "Duka la 100 m² huajiri kiongozi wa duka mwezi mmoja kabla ya ufunguzi (TSh 1,657,500), washauri watatu na mchukuaji wiki mbili kabla (TSh 1,491,750 na TSh 386,750), pamoja na sare (TSh 450,000), vyeti vya huduma ya kwanza (TSh 300,000) na matangazo (TSh 200,000): jumla TSh 4,486,000. Kipengele chake cha mtaji wa mwanzo kinapanda kutoka TSh milioni 4 hadi TSh milioni 4.5 na akiba yake inashuka kwa TSh milioni 0.5, hivyo jumla ya TSh milioni 150 haibadiliki.", "The Afya Check, advice on the floor, member enrolment and WhatsApp": "Afya Check, ushauri sakafuni mwa duka, usajili wa wanachama na WhatsApp", "The float is counted by two people at opening and at closing, and both sign on the handheld. Cash above the float is banked daily through a bank agent; the deposit slip is photographed into the system. Any difference, however small, is recorded with a reason and reviewed by the store lead the next morning.": "Fedha za kuanzia kaunta huhesabiwa na watu wawili wakati wa kufungua na kufunga, na wote wawili husaini kwenye kifaa cha mkononi. Fedha taslimu zinazozidi kiasi hicho huwekwa benki kila siku kupitia wakala wa benki; hati ya kuweka fedha hupigwa picha na kuingizwa kwenye mfumo. Tofauti yoyote, hata ndogo kiasi gani, hurekodiwa pamoja na sababu na kupitiwa na kiongozi wa duka asubuhi inayofuata.", "The quality scorecard below, read by both founders": "Kadi ya matokeo ya ubora iliyo hapa chini, inayosomwa na waanzilishi wote wawili", "The round rises to TSh 370.15M. Investors fund the setup and, at the same pre-money value, their share increases.": "Mzunguko wa uwekezaji unapanda hadi TSh milioni 370.15. Wawekezaji wanagharamia uanzishaji na, kwa thamani ileile kabla ya uwekezaji, hisa zao zinaongezeka.", "The round stays at TSh 340M. The founders fund TSh 30.15M before the round and keep their ownership.": "Mzunguko wa uwekezaji unabaki TSh milioni 340. Waanzilishi wanagharamia TSh milioni 30.15 kabla ya mzunguko na wanabaki na umiliki wao.", "The store’s monthly result, the team, compliance and complaints": "Matokeo ya duka ya kila mwezi, timu, uzingatiaji wa sheria na malalamiko", "The till refuses any barcode whose batch is recalled, expired or unregistered": "Kaunta ya malipo hukataa msimbo pau wowote ambao bechi yake imerejeshwa, imekwisha muda au haijasajiliwa", "Two people, every time": "Watu wawili, kila mara", "Two references, certificates verified, NIDA number recorded.": "Wadhamini wawili, vyeti vimehakikiwa, namba ya NIDA imerekodiwa.", "Uniforms": "Sare", "Values first: advice before sales, honesty about what Afya does not sell.": "Maadili kwanza: ushauri kabla ya mauzo, uaminifu kuhusu kile ambacho Afya haiuzi.", "What is checked": "Kinachokaguliwa", "Who did what, and when": "Nani alifanya nini, na lini", "Why product registration costs Afya nothing at launch": "Kwa nini usajili wa bidhaa hauigharimu Afya chochote wakati wa kuanza", "Within 10% of the model’s monthly result; 95% of SOP ticks on time; complaints closed within 48 hours; zero open findings": "Ndani ya 10% ya matokeo ya kila mwezi ya modeli; 95% ya alama za SOP kwa wakati; malalamiko hufungwa ndani ya saa 48; sifuri matokeo ya ukaguzi yaliyo wazi", "Workplace registration and compliance licence": "Usajili wa mahali pa kazi na leseni ya uzingatiaji wa sheria", "Year-1 pay is set at 2 to 6 times the legal minimum for each role (see the compliance module above). The master model holds salaries flat during year 1. From year 2 the growth plan uses a mature-store running cost of TSh 315M a year per store; this team’s full cost today, about TSh 100M a year, is a third of that, which leaves room for annual pay rises.": "Mshahara wa mwaka wa 1 umewekwa mara 2 hadi 6 ya kima cha chini cha mshahara kwa kila nafasi (angalia moduli ya uzingatiaji wa sheria hapo juu). Modeli kuu inashikilia mishahara bila mabadiliko katika mwaka wa 1. Kuanzia mwaka wa 2 mpango wa ukuaji unatumia gharama ya uendeshaji ya duka lililokomaa ya TSh milioni 315 kwa mwaka kwa kila duka; gharama kamili ya timu hii leo, takriban TSh milioni 100 kwa mwaka, ni theluthi moja ya kiasi hicho, jambo linaloacha nafasi ya nyongeza za mshahara za kila mwaka.", "a week per health adviser, inside the 45-hour legal limit": "kwa wiki kwa kila mshauri wa afya, ndani ya kikomo cha kisheria cha saa 45", "before expiry, a batch is pulled from sale automatically": "kabla ya kwisha muda, bechi huondolewa kwenye mauzo kiotomatiki", "checks on every pack before it reaches a shelf": "ukaguzi kwa kila pakiti kabla haijafika kwenye rafu", "every affected customer is contacted when a recall arrives": "kila mteja aliyeathirika huwasiliana naye pale taarifa ya kurejesha bidhaa inapopokelewa", "medicines handled by Afya staff: the partner pharmacy sells them": "dawa zinazoshughulikiwa na wafanyakazi wa Afya: duka la dawa mshirika ndilo huziuza", "medicines sold by Afya: a licensed partner pharmacy sells them": "dawa zinazouzwa na Afya: duka la dawa mshirika lenye leseni ndilo huziuza", "of training before anyone works a shift alone": "za mafunzo kabla ya mtu yeyote kufanya zamu peke yake", "people on the payroll of the flagship, plus one part-time relief adviser": "watu kwenye orodha ya mishahara ya duka kuu, pamoja na mshauri mmoja wa muda wa mbadala wa likizo", "to swap any device that is faulty on arrival": "kubadilisha kifaa chochote chenye hitilafu kinapowasili", "total employment cost a month, every legal cost included": "jumla ya gharama ya ajira kwa mwezi, gharama zote za kisheria zikijumuishwa", "within 1 hour": "ndani ya saa 1"});

/* v109 4.4/4.5 long-form */
Object.assign(window.AFYA_SWDICT,{", and the holder of the registration then pays a yearly retention fee: USD 200 for each registered imported device and USD 50 for each notified Class A device": ", na mmiliki wa usajili kisha hulipa ada ya kila mwaka ya kudumisha usajili: USD 200 kwa kila kifaa kilichosajiliwa kinachoingizwa kutoka nje na USD 50 kwa kila kifaa cha Daraja A kilichotolewa taarifa", ", being able to prove that every pack is genuine and in date is one of the main reasons a family will switch to Afya Basics.": ", uwezo wa kuthibitisha kwamba kila pakiti ni halisi na bado iko ndani ya muda wa matumizi ni mojawapo ya sababu kuu zitakazoifanya familia kuhamia Afya Basics.", ", roughly four weeks a year. The store must stay open, so four weeks of every role’s hours are bought back from a part-time relief adviser: TSh 7,000,000 × 4 ÷ 52 = TSh 538,462 a month, plus contributions. Using one part-time person keeps the payroll at nine, below the ten employees at which the 3.5% Skills Development Levy begins": ", takriban wiki nne kwa mwaka. Duka lazima libaki wazi, hivyo wiki nne za saa za kila nafasi hununuliwa kutoka kwa mshauri wa muda wa mbadala wa likizo: TSh 7,000,000 × 4 ÷ 52 = TSh 538,462 kwa mwezi, pamoja na michango. Kutumia mtu mmoja wa muda kunadumisha orodha ya mishahara kwa watu tisa, chini ya wafanyakazi kumi ambapo Tozo ya Kuendeleza Ujuzi ya 3.5% huanza kutozwa", ". A test strip that has been stored in heat gives a wrong reading; a wrong reading leads to a wrong decision about medication.": ". Kipande cha kipimo kilichohifadhiwa kwenye joto hutoa kipimo kisicho sahihi; kipimo kisicho sahihi husababisha uamuzi usio sahihi kuhusu dawa.", ". Afya applies the same rule to products bought locally.": ". Afya hutumia kanuni hiyohiyo kwa bidhaa zinazonunuliwa ndani ya nchi.", ". Afya’s own target is stricter: every affected customer contacted on the day the alert arrives.": ". Lengo la Afya lenyewe ni kali zaidi: kila mteja aliyeathirika huwasiliana naye siku ileile taarifa ya tahadhari inapopokelewa.", ". At launch Afya buys only brands that their Tanzanian distributors have already registered, and the distributors carry those fees. If Afya later imports devices under its own label, each product’s registration and retention fee is added to its landed cost in section 4.2 before it is ordered.": ". Wakati wa kuanza, Afya hununua chapa ambazo tayari zimesajiliwa na wasambazaji wake wa Tanzania pekee, na wasambazaji hao hubeba ada hizo. Iwapo baadaye Afya itaingiza vifaa kwa lebo yake yenyewe, ada ya usajili na ya kudumisha usajili ya kila bidhaa huongezwa kwenye gharama yake ya kufikisha bidhaa katika sehemu ya 4.2 kabla ya kuagizwa.", ". Baby lotion, sunscreen, skin care, nappies and similar products must carry the required TBS certification.": ". Losheni ya watoto, kinga ya jua, bidhaa za utunzaji wa ngozi, nepi na bidhaa zinazofanana lazima ziwe na uthibitisho unaohitajika wa TBS.", ". Because Afya Basics does not sell medicines, the store does not need Pharmacy Council registration. The partner pharmacy that sells medicines to Afya customers does.": ". Kwa kuwa Afya Basics haiuzi dawa, duka halihitaji usajili wa Baraza la Famasi. Duka la dawa mshirika linalouza dawa kwa wateja wa Afya ndilo linalouhitaji.", ". Before trading starts the workplace is registered with OSHA, which then issues a compliance licence every year after an inspection that includes the electrical installation": ". Kabla ya kuanza biashara, mahali pa kazi husajiliwa na OSHA, ambayo kisha hutoa leseni ya uzingatiaji wa sheria kila mwaka baada ya ukaguzi unaojumuisha mfumo wa umeme", ". For Afya Basics this means three things: every device on the shelf, from a thermometer to a glucose meter, must be registered or notified with TMDA; the store itself must hold a TMDA permit for dealing in medical devices, which expires every year on 30 June": ". Kwa Afya Basics hili lina maana ya mambo matatu: kila kifaa kilicho kwenye rafu, kuanzia kipimajoto hadi kipimo cha sukari, lazima kiwe kimesajiliwa au kutolewa taarifa TMDA; duka lenyewe lazima liwe na kibali cha TMDA cha kufanya biashara ya vifaa tiba, ambacho huisha muda kila mwaka tarehe 30 Juni", ". Income tax (PAYE) is charged on pay after the employee’s NSSF, using monthly bands": ". Kodi ya mapato (PAYE) hutozwa kwenye mshahara baada ya kukatwa NSSF ya mfanyakazi, kwa kutumia viwango vya kila mwezi", ". It sets TSh 240,000 a month for pharmacies in the health sector, TSh 200,500 for general business, and TSh 287,500 for postal and courier services. Comparing each Afya role with the highest category it could fall under: the store lead is paid 6.3 times the minimum, advisers 3.8 times, the picker 3.5 times and riders 2.1 times. Paying well above the minimum is a choice, not a legal requirement: it is what keeps trained people from leaving.": ". Amri hiyo inaweka TSh 240,000 kwa mwezi kwa maduka ya dawa katika sekta ya afya, TSh 200,500 kwa biashara za jumla, na TSh 287,500 kwa huduma za posta na usafirishaji wa vifurushi. Kwa kulinganisha kila nafasi ya Afya na kundi la juu kabisa ambalo ingeweza kuangukia: kiongozi wa duka analipwa mara 6.3 ya kima cha chini cha mshahara, washauri mara 3.8, mchukuaji mara 3.5 na madereva wa pikipiki mara 2.1. Kulipa juu kwa kiasi kikubwa kuliko kima cha chini ni uamuzi wa makusudi, si takwa la kisheria: ndicho kinachowazuia watu waliofunzwa kuondoka.", ". The company registers with NSSF and the Workers Compensation Fund, and deducts PAYE and pays it to TRA every month. From the second store the company will pass ten employees, and the Skills Development Levy of 3.5% of payroll will be added to the group budget.": ". Kampuni inajisajili na NSSF na Mfuko wa Fidia kwa Wafanyakazi, na hukata PAYE na kuilipa TRA kila mwezi. Kuanzia duka la pili, kampuni itazidi wafanyakazi kumi, na Tozo ya Kuendeleza Ujuzi ya 3.5% ya jumla ya mishahara itaongezwa kwenye bajeti ya kampuni kwa ujumla.", ". The full step-by-step plan, with costs and dates, is in section 7.1.": ". Mpango kamili wa hatua kwa hatua, pamoja na gharama na tarehe, uko katika sehemu ya 7.1.", ". The handling of data is explained in section 4.1.": ". Namna taarifa zinavyoshughulikiwa imeelezwa katika sehemu ya 4.1.", ". The partner pharmacy sells and dispenses them under its own licence. Afya staff never choose, recommend or hand over loose medicines; when a customer asks for one, the adviser passes the request to the partner’s pharmacist through the app, and the pharmacist calls the customer.": ". Duka la dawa mshirika huziuza na kuzitoa chini ya leseni yake lenyewe. Wafanyakazi wa Afya kamwe hawachagui, hawapendekezi wala hawakabidhi dawa zisizofungashwa; mteja anapoomba dawa, mshauri hupeleka ombi hilo kwa mfamasia wa mshirika kupitia programu, na mfamasia humpigia mteja simu.", ". The partner route keeps the flagship’s choice of site open and its payroll at eight people, while members still receive their medicines from a licensed source.": ". Njia ya mshirika inaacha wazi uchaguzi wa eneo la duka kuu na kudumisha orodha ya mishahara kwa watu wanane, huku wanachama wakiendelea kupokea dawa zao kutoka chanzo chenye leseni.", ". The store cannot close for four weeks, so one part-time relief adviser is employed to cover leave, and rider leave is covered by partner riders paid per order. That cover costs TSh 538,462 a month before contributions, and it is included in the model. The calculation is shown in the pay module below.": ". Duka haliwezi kufungwa kwa wiki nne, hivyo mshauri mmoja wa muda wa mbadala wa likizo huajiriwa kufidia likizo, na likizo ya madereva wa pikipiki hufidiwa na madereva wa pikipiki washirika wanaolipwa kwa kila oda. Mbadala huo unagharimu TSh 538,462 kwa mwezi kabla ya michango, na umejumuishwa kwenye modeli. Hesabu imeonyeshwa kwenye moduli ya mishahara hapa chini.", ". The two advisers on each late shift work until 21:15 to close and count the cash: 1.25 hours of night work per shift. Fourteen late shifts a week give about 76 hours of night work a month across the team, the same as two people working 38 hours each. At TSh 4,615 an hour (TSh 900,000 ÷ 195 hours), 5% of that is about TSh 231 an hour, so 76 hours cost about TSh 17,540 a month, or TSh 19,400 including contributions.": ". Washauri wawili wa kila zamu ya jioni hufanya kazi hadi 21:15 ili kufunga duka na kuhesabu fedha: saa 1.25 za kazi ya usiku kwa kila zamu. Zamu kumi na nne za jioni kwa wiki hutoa takriban saa 76 za kazi ya usiku kwa mwezi kwa timu nzima, sawa na watu wawili wanaofanya kazi saa 38 kila mmoja. Kwa TSh 4,615 kwa saa (TSh 900,000 ÷ saa 195), 5% ya kiasi hicho ni takriban TSh 231 kwa saa, hivyo saa 76 zinagharimu takriban TSh 17,540 kwa mwezi, au TSh 19,400 ikijumuisha michango.", "02 · In summary · what this section shows": "02 · Kwa muhtasari · sehemu hii inaonyesha nini", "03 · Why quality is the product": "03 · Kwa nini ubora ndio bidhaa yenyewe", "03 · Why the team matters more here than in an ordinary shop": "03 · Kwa nini timu ina umuhimu mkubwa zaidi hapa kuliko katika duka la kawaida", "04 · The eight people and what each one does": "04 · Watu wanane na kazi ya kila mmoja", "04 · Who regulates what, and what it means for Afya Basics": "04 · Nani anadhibiti nini, na maana yake kwa Afya Basics", "05 · How twelve hours a day, seven days a week, are covered": "05 · Jinsi saa kumi na mbili kwa siku, siku saba kwa wiki, zinavyofidiwa", "05 · What Afya Basics sells, and why medicines come from a partner pharmacy": "05 · Afya Basics inauza nini, na kwa nini dawa hutoka kwa duka la dawa mshirika", "06 · A full day in the store, hour by hour": "06 · Siku kamili dukani, saa kwa saa", "06 · How a product earns its place on the shelf": "06 · Jinsi bidhaa inavyostahili nafasi yake kwenye rafu", "07 · Keeping stock safe and in date": "07 · Kuhakikisha bidhaa ni salama na ziko ndani ya muda wa matumizi", "07 · Written procedures and the three-taps rule": "07 · Taratibu zilizoandikwa na kanuni ya miguso mitatu", "08 · Protecting cash and stock": "08 · Kulinda fedha na bidhaa", "08 · When something goes wrong · complaints, safety reports and recalls": "08 · Jambo linapoharibika · malalamiko, taarifa za usalama na urejeshaji wa bidhaa", "08:45 · Opening.": "08:45 · Ufunguzi.", "09 · After the sale · warranty, accuracy checks, rentals and returns": "09 · Baada ya mauzo · dhamana, ukaguzi wa usahihi, ukodishaji na urejeshaji", "09 · Hiring and training the first team": "09 · Kuajiri na kufundisha timu ya kwanza", "09:00 · Doors open.": "09:00 · Milango inafunguliwa.", "10 · Licences, renewals and the compliance calendar": "10 · Leseni, uhuishaji na kalenda ya uzingatiaji wa sheria", "10 · Pay, contributions and the law": "10 · Mishahara, michango na sheria", "10:00 · First delivery wave.": "10:00 · Mzunguko wa kwanza wa usafirishaji.", "11 · Measuring performance and keeping good people": "11 · Kupima utendaji na kuwabakiza watu bora", "11 · What compliance costs": "11 · Gharama ya uzingatiaji wa sheria", "11:00 · Supplier delivery.": "11:00 · Bidhaa kutoka kwa msambazaji zinawasili.", "12 · The monthly quality review": "12 · Mapitio ya ubora ya kila mwezi", "12 · The smaller first store": "12 · Duka la kwanza lililo dogo zaidi", "13 · What could go wrong, and what we do about it": "13 · Nini kinaweza kwenda kombo, na tunachofanya kukabiliana nacho", "13:00 · Second wave.": "13:00 · Mzunguko wa pili.", "14:45 to 15:30 · Handover.": "14:45 hadi 15:30 · Makabidhiano.", "15:00 · Same-day cut-off.": "15:00 · Mwisho wa kupokea oda za siku hiyohiyo.", "16:00 · Third wave.": "16:00 · Mzunguko wa tatu.", "18:00 · Evening.": "18:00 · Jioni.", "2 months × TSh 1,500,000 × 1.105": "miezi 2 × TSh 1,500,000 × 1.105", "20:30 · Closing begins.": "20:30 · Maandalizi ya kufunga yanaanza.", "21:00 · Doors close and cash-up.": "21:00 · Milango inafungwa na fedha za siku zinahesabiwa.", "; and any safety problem with a device must be reported to TMDA.": "; na tatizo lolote la usalama la kifaa lazima liripotiwe TMDA.", "; the government gave unregistered workplaces 90 days from January 2026 to comply": "; Serikali ilitoa kwa maeneo ya kazi yasiyosajiliwa siku 90 kuanzia Januari 2026 kutimiza masharti", "A Tanzanian regulatory adviser reviews the compliance calendar every year, and changes are recorded in section 7.1.": "Mshauri wa masuala ya udhibiti wa Tanzania hupitia kalenda ya uzingatiaji wa sheria kila mwaka, na mabadiliko hurekodiwa katika sehemu ya 7.1.", "A business like Afya Basics needs a set of registrations before it opens and a set of renewals every year. Missing a renewal can close the store, so each one is entered in the system with an owner and a due date, and an alert is raised 60 days before it falls due. The founders do not have to remember them.": "Biashara kama Afya Basics inahitaji usajili kadhaa kabla ya kufunguliwa na uhuishaji kadhaa kila mwaka. Kukosa kuhuisha kunaweza kusababisha duka kufungwa, hivyo kila kimoja huingizwa kwenye mfumo pamoja na mhusika na tarehe ya mwisho, na tahadhari hutolewa siku 60 kabla ya tarehe hiyo. Waanzilishi hawalazimiki kuvikumbuka.", "A falsified or recalled product reaches a customer.": "Bidhaa bandia au iliyorejeshwa inamfikia mteja.", "A family buying a glucose meter, a pack of test strips or sterile dressings usually cannot tell whether the product is genuine, whether it is close to its expiry date, or whether it was stored correctly. The World Health Organization estimates that about one in ten medical products in low- and middle-income countries is substandard or falsified": "Familia inayonunua kipimo cha sukari, pakiti ya vipande vya vipimo au bendeji tasa kwa kawaida haiwezi kujua kama bidhaa ni halisi, kama inakaribia tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi, au kama ilihifadhiwa ipasavyo. Shirika la Afya Duniani (WHO) linakadiria kuwa takriban bidhaa moja kati ya kumi za matibabu katika nchi za kipato cha chini na cha kati ni duni au bandia", "A health store feels this problem more than most. A customer choosing a blood-pressure monitor, the right nappy size for a growing baby, or a walking frame for a parent after a fall is not only buying a product. They are asking for advice, and they need to trust that the advice is honest. If the person behind the counter is trained to sell rather than to advise, the customer is given a price, not guidance, and does not come back.": "Duka la bidhaa za afya huathiriwa na tatizo hili kuliko mengine mengi. Mteja anayechagua kipimo cha shinikizo la damu, ukubwa sahihi wa nepi kwa mtoto anayekua, au fremu ya kutembelea kwa mzazi baada ya kuanguka hanunui bidhaa tu. Anaomba ushauri, na anahitaji kuamini kwamba ushauri huo ni wa kweli. Ikiwa mtu aliye nyuma ya kaunta amefunzwa kuuza badala ya kushauri, mteja hupewa bei, si mwongozo, na harudi tena.", "A parent will later buy these dressings after a child’s fall. Before they reach the Mobility & Recovery shelf: 1. Registration: the dressing is on TMDA’s register, or the correct exemption is recorded. 2. Label: the label is in Kiswahili or English, shows the maker’s name and address, and states that the product is sterile and how it was sterilised. 3. Batch number: scanned and linked to the supplier and to this delivery, so every future sale can be traced. 4. Expiry date: enough shelf life is left on arrival, and the system will sell the oldest batch first. 5. Pack integrity: a sterile pack that is torn or damp is no longer sterile and is never sold. If any of the five is missing, the system refuses to accept the item, and the till will refuse its barcode.": "Mzazi atanunua bendeji hizi baadaye baada ya mtoto kuanguka. Kabla hazijafika kwenye rafu ya Mobility & Recovery: 1. Usajili: bendeji imo kwenye rejista ya TMDA, au msamaha sahihi umerekodiwa. 2. Lebo: lebo iko kwa Kiswahili au Kiingereza, inaonyesha jina na anwani ya mtengenezaji, na inaeleza kwamba bidhaa ni tasa na jinsi ilivyotakaswa. 3. Namba ya toleo (batch): inaskaniwa na kuunganishwa na msambazaji na mzigo huu, ili kila mauzo ya baadaye yaweze kufuatiliwa. 4. Tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi: muda wa kutosha wa matumizi umebaki wakati wa kuwasili, na mfumo utauza toleo la zamani zaidi kwanza. 5. Uimara wa pakiti: pakiti tasa iliyochanika au yenye unyevu si tasa tena na kamwe haiuzwi. Iwapo chochote kati ya hivi vitano kinakosekana, mfumo hukataa kupokea bidhaa hiyo, na kaunta ya malipo hukataa msimbo pau wake.", "A recall is when a maker or TMDA withdraws a batch from the market. Because every unit Afya sells is linked to its batch, and for members and app buyers also to the customer, the system can list every affected household within seconds. Afya follows seven steps: the alert is received; the till is set to refuse the batch barcode; the system traces every buyer; each one is contacted by SMS, WhatsApp or phone the same day; the product is collected, refunded or replaced; the return is reported to TMDA and the stock quarantined; and the cause is reviewed with the supplier.": "Urejeshaji wa bidhaa hutokea pale mtengenezaji au TMDA anapoondoa toleo (batch) fulani sokoni. Kwa kuwa kila kipande ambacho Afya huuza kimeunganishwa na toleo lake, na kwa wanachama na wanunuzi wa kupitia programu pia kimeunganishwa na mteja, mfumo unaweza kuorodhesha kila kaya iliyoathirika ndani ya sekunde chache. Afya hufuata hatua saba: taarifa ya tahadhari hupokelewa; kaunta ya malipo huwekwa kukataa msimbo pau wa toleo hilo; mfumo hufuatilia kila mnunuzi; kila mmoja huwasiliana naye kwa SMS, WhatsApp au simu siku hiyohiyo; bidhaa hukusanywa, fedha hurejeshwa au bidhaa hubadilishwa; urejeshaji huripotiwa TMDA na bidhaa zilizobaki hutengwa; na chanzo cha tatizo hupitiwa pamoja na msambazaji.", "Advisers are not paid commission and are not measured on how much a customer spends in one visit. They are measured on how many members are still active after three months. This is deliberate. A member who is pushed into an expensive box cancels; a member who is advised honestly stays, and a member who stays is worth far more to the business than one large sale.": "Washauri hawalipwi kamisheni na hawapimwi kwa kiasi ambacho mteja hutumia katika ziara moja. Hupimwa kwa idadi ya wanachama wanaoendelea kuwa hai baada ya miezi mitatu. Hili ni la makusudi. Mwanachama anayeshinikizwa kununua boksi la bei ghali hujiondoa; mwanachama anayeshauriwa kwa uaminifu hubaki, na mwanachama anayebaki ana thamani kubwa zaidi kwa biashara kuliko mauzo makubwa ya mara moja.", "Advisers are trained to stop and hand over. The request goes to the partner pharmacy’s pharmacist through the app and the customer is called back. Every hand-over is logged, so the founders can check that no medicine advice was given by Afya staff.": "Washauri wamefunzwa kusita na kukabidhi. Ombi hupelekwa kwa mfamasia wa duka la dawa mshirika kupitia programu, na mteja hupigiwa simu baadaye. Kila ukabidhi hurekodiwa, hivyo waanzilishi wanaweza kuhakiki kwamba hakuna ushauri wa dawa uliotolewa na wafanyakazi wa Afya.", "After opening, the recurring duties are: VAT and payroll returns every month; the temperature log and complaint log reviewed every month; a mock recall and an offline-till test every quarter; an expiry review of all stock due within 90 days every quarter; the TMDA permit renewed before 30 June every year; the partner pharmacy’s renewed permit and pharmacist registration filed every June; the business licence, OSHA compliance licence and fire certificate renewed every year; each product’s TMDA registration or TBS certificate checked before every first order; and the PDPC registration renewed every five years.": "Baada ya ufunguzi, majukumu yanayojirudia ni: ritani za VAT na za mishahara kila mwezi; kumbukumbu ya joto na kumbukumbu ya malalamiko kupitiwa kila mwezi; zoezi la kurejesha bidhaa na jaribio la kaunta ya malipo bila mtandao kila robo mwaka; mapitio ya bidhaa zote zitakazoisha muda ndani ya siku 90 kila robo mwaka; kibali cha TMDA kuhuishwa kabla ya 30 Juni kila mwaka; kibali kilichohuishwa cha duka la dawa mshirika na usajili wa mfamasia kuhifadhiwa kwenye jalada kila Juni; leseni ya biashara, leseni ya uzingatiaji wa sheria ya OSHA na cheti cha zimamoto kuhuishwa kila mwaka; usajili wa TMDA au cheti cha TBS cha kila bidhaa kukaguliwa kabla ya kila oda ya kwanza; na usajili wa PDPC kuhuishwa kila baada ya miaka mitano.", "Afya Basics applies the strictest of the four standards to everything it sells: if it is not clear which authority regulates a product, the product is not stocked until the authority confirms it in writing.": "Afya Basics hutumia kiwango kikali zaidi kati ya viwango vinne kwa kila kitu inachouza: iwapo haiko wazi ni mamlaka ipi inayodhibiti bidhaa fulani, bidhaa hiyo haiwekwi dukani hadi mamlaka ithibitishe kwa maandishi.", "Afya Basics is designed so that the standard does not depend on any one person. Every routine task is written down, done on a handheld device, and recorded with a name and a time. Anything not done appears in a report that the founders read every night.": "Afya Basics imeundwa ili kiwango cha huduma kisitegemee mtu mmoja. Kila kazi ya kawaida imeandikwa, hufanywa kwenye kifaa cha mkononi, na hurekodiwa pamoja na jina na muda. Chochote ambacho hakijafanyika huonekana kwenye ripoti ambayo waanzilishi huisoma kila usiku.", "Afya launches only with brands that are already registered": "Afya inaanza kwa chapa ambazo tayari zimesajiliwa pekee", "All complaints go into one log, whether they arrive in the store, on WhatsApp or by phone. During opening hours every complaint is acknowledged within five minutes, owned by the store lead and closed only when the customer agrees it is resolved. A complaint about the safety or performance of a product is also reported to TMDA, which accepts reports through its online tools and the USSD code *152*00#": "Malalamiko yote huingizwa kwenye kumbukumbu moja, yawe yamefika dukani, kwa WhatsApp au kwa simu. Katika saa za kazi kila lalamiko hupokelewa na kujibiwa ndani ya dakika tano, husimamiwa na kiongozi wa duka na hufungwa pale tu mteja anapokubali kwamba limetatuliwa. Lalamiko kuhusu usalama au ufanisi wa bidhaa pia huripotiwa TMDA, ambayo hupokea taarifa kupitia mifumo yake ya mtandaoni na msimbo wa USSD *152*00#", "An adviser is asked about a medicine.": "Mshauri anaulizwa kuhusu dawa.", "Any number that misses its target is written up with a cause and an action, and checked again the next month. The same report is shared with the board (section 7.2).": "Takwimu yoyote isiyofikia lengo lake huandikwa pamoja na sababu na hatua ya kuchukua, na hukaguliwa tena mwezi unaofuata. Ripoti hiyohiyo hushirikishwa kwa bodi (sehemu ya 7.2).", "At 10:00 TMDA notifies a Class II recall of one batch of test strips. By 10:05 the till refuses that batch. The system shows 14 units sold: 9 to Sukari Care members inside their monthly boxes and 5 to walk-in customers who gave their phone number for their receipt. By 13:00 all 14 have been contacted. The members receive replacement strips from a different batch in the afternoon delivery wave; the walk-in customers are offered a refund or a replacement in the store. The 22 units still in the stockroom are quarantined, and the return report is sent to TMDA the same week.": "Saa 10:00 TMDA inatoa taarifa ya urejeshaji wa bidhaa wa Daraja II kwa toleo moja la vipande vya vipimo. Kufikia 10:05 kaunta ya malipo inakataa toleo hilo. Mfumo unaonyesha vipande 14 vimeuzwa: 9 kwa wanachama wa Sukari Care ndani ya maboksi yao ya kila mwezi na 5 kwa wateja wa kupita waliotoa namba zao za simu kwa ajili ya risiti. Kufikia 13:00 wote 14 wamewasiliana nao. Wanachama wanapokea vipande mbadala kutoka toleo jingine katika mzunguko wa usafirishaji wa mchana; wateja wa kupita wanapewa chaguo la kurejeshewa fedha au kubadilishiwa bidhaa dukani. Vipande 22 vilivyobaki stoo vinatengwa, na ripoti ya urejeshaji inatumwa TMDA wiki hiyohiyo.", "At 21:00 the report shows a TSh 43,000 Presha Care sale with no matching mobile-money payment. The handheld shows which adviser made the sale and when. The next morning the store lead checks the payment provider’s statement: the customer’s payment failed and the box was handed over anyway. The customer is called, pays, and the adviser is retrained on waiting for the payment confirmation. The loss is caught within twelve hours instead of at the month-end count.": "Saa 21:00 ripoti inaonyesha mauzo ya Presha Care ya TSh 43,000 yasiyo na malipo ya pesa ya simu yanayolingana nayo. Kifaa cha mkononi kinaonyesha mshauri aliyefanya mauzo hayo na muda wake. Asubuhi inayofuata kiongozi wa duka anakagua taarifa ya mtoa huduma ya malipo: malipo ya mteja yalishindikana lakini boksi lilikabidhiwa hata hivyo. Mteja anapigiwa simu na kulipa, na mshauri anapewa mafunzo upya kuhusu kusubiri uthibitisho wa malipo. Hasara inagunduliwa ndani ya saa kumi na mbili badala ya kwenye hesabu ya bidhaa ya mwisho wa mwezi.", "Because every procedure lives in the system and every adviser is trained across all zones, the store keeps running to the same standard. The senior adviser already acts as duty manager and can step up. Fair pay, training and a clear path to lead the next store reduce the chance of losing people in the first place.": "Kwa kuwa kila utaratibu umo kwenye mfumo na kila mshauri amefunzwa katika maeneo yote, duka huendelea kufanya kazi kwa kiwango kilekile. Mshauri mwandamizi tayari hufanya kazi kama meneja wa zamu na anaweza kushika nafasi. Mshahara wa haki, mafunzo na njia iliyo wazi ya kuongoza duka linalofuata hupunguza uwezekano wa kupoteza watu tangu mwanzo.", "Before any product reaches a shelf, two things have happened. Its supplier has been approved, and the specific delivery has passed five checks.": "Kabla bidhaa yoyote haijafika kwenye rafu, mambo mawili yamekwisha kufanyika. Msambazaji wake ameidhinishwa, na mzigo husika umepita ukaguzi mara tano.", "Before opening, the company is incorporated with BRELA, registers for tax with TRA (a TIN within 15 days of starting business, and VAT because taxable sales will pass TSh 100 million a year), obtains a business licence, registers the workplace with OSHA, registers with the Workers Compensation Fund within 30 days of hiring the first employee, obtains a fire safety certificate after an inspection, obtains the TMDA permit for dealing in medical devices, and registers with the PDPC": "Kabla ya ufunguzi, kampuni husajiliwa BRELA, hujisajili kwa kodi TRA (TIN ndani ya siku 15 tangu kuanza biashara, na VAT kwa sababu mauzo yanayotozwa kodi yatazidi TSh milioni 100 kwa mwaka), hupata leseni ya biashara, husajili mahali pa kazi OSHA, hujisajili na Mfuko wa Fidia kwa Wafanyakazi ndani ya siku 30 tangu kuajiri mfanyakazi wa kwanza, hupata cheti cha usalama dhidi ya moto baada ya ukaguzi, hupata kibali cha TMDA cha kufanya biashara ya vifaa tiba, na hujisajili PDPC", "Cash.": "Fedha taslimu.", "Deliveries checked for batch and expiry on arrival": "Mizigo inayowasili hukaguliwa toleo na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi wakati wa kuwasili", "Device registration takes up to 240 days for Classes B to D.": "Usajili wa vifaa huchukua hadi siku 240 kwa Daraja B hadi D.", "Each day has two shifts. The early shift runs from 08:45 to 15:30 (6¾ hours, including the opening checks) and the late shift from 14:45 to 21:15 (6½ hours, including closing and the cash-up). The shifts overlap for 45 minutes in the afternoon. The overlap sits there on purpose: 15:00 is the cut-off for same-day orders, so it is the busiest packing time, and it is when the early pair hand over open WhatsApp conversations, follow-up calls and red Afya Check readings to the late pair.": "Kila siku ina zamu mbili. Zamu ya asubuhi ni kuanzia 08:45 hadi 15:30 (saa 6¾, ikijumuisha ukaguzi wa ufunguzi) na zamu ya jioni ni kuanzia 14:45 hadi 21:15 (saa 6½, ikijumuisha kufunga duka na kuhesabu fedha za siku). Zamu hizi hupishana kwa dakika 45 mchana. Mpishano huo umewekwa hapo kwa makusudi: 15:00 ndio mwisho wa kupokea oda za siku hiyohiyo, hivyo ni wakati wenye shughuli nyingi zaidi za kufungasha, na ndio wakati ambapo jozi ya asubuhi hukabidhi kwa jozi ya jioni mazungumzo ya WhatsApp yaliyo wazi, simu za ufuatiliaji na vipimo vyekundu vya Afya Check.", "Each role has a small number of targets, all read from the system rather than from a manager’s impression. The store lead is measured on the store’s monthly result against the model, on 95% of checklist items done on time, and on complaints closed within 48 hours. Advisers are measured on members who are still active after three months (the model assumes 8% of members leave each month, so the target is to stay at or below that), on WhatsApp replies within five minutes, and on every red Afya Check reading being followed up within three days. The picker is measured on getting 99.5% of order lines right and on photographing every box. Riders are measured on delivering 95% of orders in the promised wave and on confirming every handover with a code and a photo.": "Kila nafasi ina malengo machache, yote yakisomwa kutoka kwenye mfumo badala ya maoni ya meneja. Kiongozi wa duka hupimwa kwa matokeo ya duka ya kila mwezi dhidi ya modeli, kwa 95% ya vipengele vya orodha ya ukaguzi kukamilika kwa wakati, na kwa malalamiko kufungwa ndani ya saa 48. Washauri hupimwa kwa wanachama wanaoendelea kuwa hai baada ya miezi mitatu (modeli inakadiria kwamba 8% ya wanachama huondoka kila mwezi, hivyo lengo ni kubaki kwenye kiwango hicho au chini yake), kwa kujibu WhatsApp ndani ya dakika tano, na kwa kila kipimo chekundu cha Afya Check kufuatiliwa ndani ya siku tatu. Mchukuaji hupimwa kwa usahihi wa 99.5% wa vipengele vya oda na kwa kupiga picha kila boksi. Madereva wa pikipiki hupimwa kwa kusafirisha 95% ya oda ndani ya mzunguko ulioahidiwa na kwa kuthibitisha kila makabidhiano kwa msimbo na picha.", "Each salary against the legal minimum": "Kila mshahara ukilinganishwa na kima cha chini kisheria", "Eight people is a small team for that amount of work. It is possible for one reason: the routine work that normally needs a cashier, a stock clerk and an office administrator is done by the system. Prices, stock counts, receipts, reminders, reorders and reports are produced automatically. The people are left with the work that only people can do well: advising a customer, packing a box correctly and handing it over at the door.": "Watu wanane ni timu ndogo kwa kiasi hicho cha kazi. Inawezekana kwa sababu moja: kazi za kawaida ambazo kwa kawaida huhitaji mtunza fedha, karani wa bidhaa na msimamizi wa ofisi hufanywa na mfumo. Bei, hesabu za bidhaa, risiti, vikumbusho, oda za kujaza bidhaa na ripoti huzalishwa kiotomatiki. Watu hubaki na kazi ambayo ni watu pekee wanaweza kuifanya vizuri: kumshauri mteja, kufungasha boksi kwa usahihi na kulikabidhi mlangoni.", "Estimate": "Makadirio", "Every candidate goes through the same four steps. First, their qualifications are checked against the role: a registered physiotherapy or nursing diploma for the store lead; a health-related certificate or diploma, or retail experience with good Kiswahili and English, for advisers; a valid licence and two years of riding experience for riders. Second, a practical test: advisers explain a blood-pressure reading to a role-play customer, pickers pick a ten-line order against the clock, riders complete a route test. Third, an interview with both founders, focused on values: advice before sales, and honesty about what Afya does not sell. Fourth, two references are taken and certificates are verified.": "Kila mwombaji hupitia hatua nne zilezile. Kwanza, sifa zake hukaguliwa kulingana na nafasi: stashahada iliyosajiliwa ya fiziotherapia au uuguzi kwa kiongozi wa duka; cheti au stashahada inayohusiana na afya, au uzoefu wa rejareja pamoja na umahiri wa Kiswahili na Kiingereza, kwa washauri; leseni halali na uzoefu wa miaka miwili wa kuendesha pikipiki kwa madereva wa pikipiki. Pili, jaribio la vitendo: washauri humweleza mteja wa kuigiza kipimo cha shinikizo la damu, wachukuaji hukusanya oda ya vipengele kumi kwa muda uliopimwa, madereva wa pikipiki hukamilisha jaribio la njia. Tatu, usaili na waanzilishi wote wawili, unaolenga maadili: ushauri kabla ya mauzo, na uaminifu kuhusu kile ambacho Afya haiuzi. Nne, maoni ya wadhamini wawili huchukuliwa na vyeti huhakikiwa.", "Every delivery is checked by two people. A fifth of all products is counted each week, so the whole range is counted every five weeks; high-value devices are counted every month; and the whole store is counted every quarter. The target is that the system and the shelf agree on at least 98% of products. Cameras cover the till, the stockroom and the entrance, and recordings are kept for 30 days.": "Kila mzigo unaowasili hukaguliwa na watu wawili. Sehemu moja ya tano ya bidhaa zote huhesabiwa kila wiki, hivyo bidhaa zote huhesabiwa kila baada ya wiki tano; vifaa vya thamani kubwa huhesabiwa kila mwezi; na duka zima huhesabiwa kila robo mwaka. Lengo ni mfumo na rafu kulingana kwa angalau 98% ya bidhaa. Kamera hufunika kaunta ya malipo, stoo na mlango wa kuingilia, na rekodi huhifadhiwa kwa siku 30.", "Every device carries an Afya warranty card that states the maker’s warranty period and is linked to the customer’s phone number, so no paper receipt is needed. A device that is faulty within seven days of purchase is replaced in the store or at the door. After seven days, Afya manages the warranty claim with the supplier on the customer’s behalf.": "Kila kifaa huambatana na kadi ya dhamana ya Afya inayoonyesha muda wa dhamana wa mtengenezaji na imeunganishwa na namba ya simu ya mteja, hivyo risiti ya karatasi haihitajiki. Kifaa chenye hitilafu ndani ya siku saba tangu kununuliwa hubadilishwa dukani au mlangoni. Baada ya siku saba, Afya hushughulikia dai la dhamana kwa msambazaji kwa niaba ya mteja.", "Every employee has a 20-minute one-to-one with the store lead each month, a scorecard review every quarter and a yearly review with both founders that sets their pay for the next year. There is a clear path upwards: health adviser, then senior adviser and duty manager in year 1, then store lead of the second store when it opens in year 2, then area lead across four stores in year 3. Promotions are filled from inside first, so each new store opens with a lead who already knows the system.": "Kila mfanyakazi ana kikao cha ana kwa ana cha dakika 20 na kiongozi wa duka kila mwezi, mapitio ya kadi ya matokeo kila robo mwaka na mapitio ya kila mwaka pamoja na waanzilishi wote wawili yanayopanga mshahara wake wa mwaka unaofuata. Kuna njia iliyo wazi ya kupanda cheo: mshauri wa afya, kisha mshauri mwandamizi na meneja wa zamu katika mwaka wa 1, kisha kiongozi wa duka la pili litakapofunguliwa katika mwaka wa 2, kisha kiongozi wa eneo kwa maduka manne katika mwaka wa 3. Nafasi za kupandishwa cheo hujazwa kwanza kutoka ndani, hivyo kila duka jipya hufunguliwa likiwa na kiongozi anayeujua mfumo tayari.", "Every employee is entitled to 28 days of paid annual leave": "Kila mfanyakazi ana haki ya likizo ya mwaka yenye malipo ya siku 28", "Every employee signs a written contract before the first shift. The contract states the leave the law gives: 28 days of annual leave; sick leave of 126 days in a three-year cycle, the first 63 on full pay; 84 days of maternity leave (100 for multiple births); 3 days of paternity leave; and 28 days of notice after the first month": "Kila mfanyakazi husaini mkataba wa maandishi kabla ya zamu yake ya kwanza. Mkataba unaeleza likizo zinazotolewa na sheria: likizo ya mwaka ya siku 28; likizo ya ugonjwa ya siku 126 katika mzunguko wa miaka mitatu, siku 63 za kwanza kwa mshahara kamili; likizo ya uzazi ya siku 84 (100 kwa watoto zaidi ya mmoja); likizo ya uzazi kwa baba ya siku 3; na notisi ya siku 28 baada ya mwezi wa kwanza", "Every product Afya Basics sells must be registered with the right authority, sold well within its expiry date, traceable to its batch, and backed by a written warranty. A product whose status is unclear is not stocked until it is clarified.": "Kila bidhaa ambayo Afya Basics huuza lazima iwe imesajiliwa na mamlaka husika, iuzwe muda mrefu kabla ya tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi, iweze kufuatiliwa hadi toleo (batch) lake, na iwe na dhamana ya maandishi. Bidhaa ambayo hali yake haiko wazi haiwekwi dukani hadi ifafanuliwe.", "Every quarter the team runs a mock recall on a real batch, without contacting customers, to prove that the full list can be produced within one hour.": "Kila robo mwaka timu hufanya zoezi la kurejesha bidhaa kwa toleo halisi, bila kuwasiliana na wateja, ili kuthibitisha kwamba orodha kamili inaweza kutolewa ndani ya saa moja.", "Every routine task in the store is a written procedure that runs on the staff handheld as a checklist. Each tick records who did it and when. A task not done on time appears in the 21:00 report. This means the founders can see every evening whether the store ran to standard, without being there.": "Kila kazi ya kawaida dukani ni utaratibu ulioandikwa unaoendeshwa kwenye kifaa cha mkononi cha wafanyakazi kama orodha ya ukaguzi. Kila alama ya tiki hurekodi aliyeifanya na muda. Kazi isiyofanyika kwa wakati huonekana kwenye ripoti ya 21:00. Hii ina maana kwamba waanzilishi wanaweza kuona kila jioni kama duka liliendeshwa kwa kiwango kinachotakiwa, bila kuwepo dukani.", "Example · a member who needs medicine": "Mfano · mwanachama anayehitaji dawa", "Example · a recalled batch of test strips": "Mfano · toleo la vipande vya vipimo lililorejeshwa", "Example · five checks on a box of sterile dressings": "Mfano · ukaguzi mara tano kwa boksi la bendeji tasa", "Example · how a mismatch is caught": "Mfano · jinsi tofauti inavyogunduliwa", "Example · receiving a carton of test strips": "Mfano · kupokea katoni ya vipande vya vipimo", "Expired stock also reaches homes when a shop has no record of batches and dates. New deliveries are put in front of old ones, and the old stock sits at the back until it is either sold or thrown away.": "Bidhaa zilizokwisha muda pia hufika majumbani pale duka linapokosa kumbukumbu za matoleo na tarehe. Mizigo mipya huwekwa mbele ya ile ya zamani, na bidhaa za zamani hukaa nyuma hadi ziuzwe au zitupwe.", "Finally, most shops have no route for after-sale problems. If a blood-pressure monitor reads inconsistently, or a batch is recalled, the customer often has nowhere to go. Afya Basics treats each of these four problems as part of the service it sells.": "Mwisho, maduka mengi hayana utaratibu wa kushughulikia matatizo baada ya mauzo. Iwapo kipimo cha shinikizo la damu kinatoa vipimo visivyolingana, au toleo fulani linarejeshwa, mara nyingi mteja hana pa kwenda. Afya Basics inachukulia kila moja ya matatizo haya manne kama sehemu ya huduma inayouza.", "Four advisers, three weeks before opening": "Washauri wanne, wiki tatu kabla ya ufunguzi", "Health advisers · 4 people · TSh 900,000 a month each": "Washauri wa afya · watu 4 · TSh 900,000 kwa mwezi kila mmoja", "Home blood-pressure monitors drift over time, cuffs wear and batteries weaken. Any customer can bring their monitor to the Afya Check kiosk and compare its reading with the kiosk’s, free of charge, at any time. Customers who trust their readings keep measuring, which is what their doctors want.": "Vipimo vya shinikizo la damu vya nyumbani hupoteza usahihi kadiri muda unavyopita, mikanda huchakaa na betri hudhoofika. Mteja yeyote anaweza kuleta kipimo chake kwenye kibanda cha Afya Check na kulinganisha usomaji wake na wa kibanda, bila malipo, wakati wowote. Wateja wanaoamini vipimo vyao huendelea kujipima, jambo ambalo madaktari wao wanalitaka.", "If the founders start with the smaller TSh 150 million option, the store is 100 m² on a secondary street and opens from 09:00 to 20:00, seven days a week: 77 hours. Shifts run from 08:45 to 14:45 and from 14:15 to 20:15. It is run by five people: a store lead, three health advisers and a picker and packer. Deliveries are made by partner riders paid per order, and a simple check corner replaces the Afya Check kiosk.": "Iwapo waanzilishi wataanza na chaguo dogo la TSh milioni 150, duka litakuwa la 100 m² kwenye barabara ya pili na litafunguliwa kuanzia 09:00 hadi 20:00, siku saba kwa wiki: saa 77. Zamu ni kuanzia 08:45 hadi 14:45 na kuanzia 14:15 hadi 20:15. Litaendeshwa na watu watano: kiongozi wa duka, washauri wa afya watatu na mchukuaji na mfungaji. Usafirishaji utafanywa na madereva wa pikipiki washirika wanaolipwa kwa kila oda, na kona rahisi ya vipimo itachukua nafasi ya kibanda cha Afya Check.", "Imported products must also arrive with enough shelf life. TMDA’s rule is at least 60% of the total shelf life remaining for products with more than 24 months of shelf life, and at least 80% for products with 24 months or less": "Bidhaa zinazoingizwa kutoka nje pia lazima ziwasili zikiwa na muda wa kutosha wa matumizi. Kanuni ya TMDA ni angalau 60% ya muda wote wa matumizi kubaki kwa bidhaa zenye muda wa matumizi unaozidi miezi 24, na angalau 80% kwa bidhaa zenye miezi 24 au chini ya hapo", "In most Dar es Salaam shops, the quality of service depends on one good employee. When that person is on shift, customers are greeted, stock is in order and questions are answered. When that person is off sick or leaves for another job, the standard leaves with them. The owner usually cannot be in the shop all day to notice.": "Katika maduka mengi ya Dar es Salaam, ubora wa huduma hutegemea mfanyakazi mmoja mzuri. Mtu huyo anapokuwa zamuni, wateja hukaribishwa, bidhaa hupangwa vizuri na maswali hujibiwa. Mtu huyo anapokuwa mgonjwa au anapoondoka kwenda kazi nyingine, kiwango huondoka pamoja naye. Kwa kawaida mmiliki hawezi kuwa dukani siku nzima ili kugundua hilo.", "In retail, money is usually lost in three places: at the till, on the payment screen and in the stockroom. Each has a control that runs every day.": "Katika rejareja, fedha kwa kawaida hupotea sehemu tatu: kwenye kaunta ya malipo, kwenye skrini ya malipo na stoo. Kila moja ina udhibiti unaofanyika kila siku.", "It is not clear which authority regulates a product,": "Haiko wazi ni mamlaka ipi inayodhibiti bidhaa fulani,", "Job adverts, interviews, reference checks": "Matangazo ya kazi, usaili, uhakiki wa wadhamini", "Leave cover: every employee is entitled to 28 days of paid annual leave": "Mbadala wa likizo: kila mfanyakazi ana haki ya likizo ya mwaka yenye malipo ya siku 28", "Less PAYE: TSh 68,000 on the first TSh 760,000, plus 25% of the remaining TSh 50,000": "Toa PAYE: TSh 68,000 kwa TSh 760,000 za kwanza, pamoja na 25% ya TSh 50,000 zilizobaki", "Less employee NSSF, 10%": "Toa NSSF ya mfanyakazi, 10%", "Lunch-hour orders go out. The advisers take the Afya Check queue, which is busiest at lunchtime.": "Oda za saa ya chakula cha mchana zinatoka. Washauri wanahudumia foleni ya Afya Check, ambayo huwa na watu wengi zaidi wakati wa mchana.", "Mama Neema is a Presha Care member. Her clinic has prescribed blood-pressure tablets. In the Afya app she adds “medicines from the pharmacy” to her monthly order. The partner pharmacist calls her, checks the prescription and confirms the medicine and the dose. The pharmacy sells the tablets on its own receipt, and Mama Neema pays the pharmacy directly through its own mobile-money number. The pharmacy packs the tablets in a sealed bag labelled with her name and the pharmacy’s details. When the Afya rider collects her monthly box, the sealed bag travels with it and is handed over with the same confirmation code. At no point does any Afya employee choose, open, sell or take payment for the medicine.": "Mama Neema ni mwanachama wa Presha Care. Kliniki yake imemwandikia vidonge vya shinikizo la damu. Kwenye programu ya Afya anaongeza “dawa kutoka duka la dawa” kwenye oda yake ya kila mwezi. Mfamasia wa mshirika anampigia simu, anakagua cheti cha daktari na anathibitisha dawa na kipimo chake. Duka la dawa linauza vidonge hivyo kwa risiti yake lenyewe, na Mama Neema analipa duka la dawa moja kwa moja kupitia namba yake ya pesa ya simu. Duka la dawa linafungasha vidonge ndani ya mfuko uliofungwa wenye lebo inayoonyesha jina lake na taarifa za duka la dawa. Dereva wa pikipiki wa Afya anapochukua boksi lake la kila mwezi, mfuko uliofungwa husafirishwa pamoja nalo na hukabidhiwa kwa msimbo uleule wa uthibitisho. Hakuna wakati wowote ambapo mfanyakazi wa Afya huchagua, hufungua, huuza au hupokea malipo ya dawa hiyo.", "Medicines are still part of what members need, so they come from a licensed retail pharmacy near the store, under a written agreement. The partner pharmacy is registered with the Pharmacy Council and run by its own pharmacist in charge": "Dawa bado ni sehemu ya mahitaji ya wanachama, hivyo hutoka kwa duka la rejareja la dawa lenye leseni lililo karibu na duka, chini ya makubaliano ya maandishi. Duka la dawa mshirika limesajiliwa na Baraza la Famasi na huendeshwa na mfamasia mkuu wake mwenyewe", "Mobile money and cards.": "Pesa za simu na kadi.", "Most customers pay by M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, HaloPesa or card. The system matches every payment to its sale automatically. A payment without a sale, or a sale without a payment, appears as an exception. Refunds and price changes need the store lead’s or duty manager’s PIN, so no single person can both make a sale and refund it.": "Wateja wengi hulipa kwa M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, HaloPesa au kadi. Mfumo huoanisha kila malipo na mauzo yake kiotomatiki. Malipo yasiyo na mauzo, au mauzo yasiyo na malipo, huonekana kama hitilafu. Marejesho ya fedha na mabadiliko ya bei yanahitaji PIN ya kiongozi wa duka au ya meneja wa zamu, hivyo hakuna mtu mmoja anayeweza kuuza na pia kurejesha fedha za mauzo hayo.", "Most shops end the relationship at the till. With health products, the important moments often come later.": "Maduka mengi humaliza uhusiano na mteja kwenye kaunta ya malipo. Kwa bidhaa za afya, mara nyingi nyakati muhimu huja baadaye.", "Most test strips, devices and dressings are labelled for storage at normal room temperature and away from humidity. Afya keeps the shop floor and the stockroom between 15 and 25 °C and below 65% humidity. Small data loggers record both every 15 minutes and raise an alarm if either goes out of range; the store lead reviews any alarm within 24 hours. If a product needs a different range, the system records it and the product is stored accordingly.": "Vipande vingi vya vipimo, vifaa na bendeji vimeandikiwa kwenye lebo kuhifadhiwa katika joto la kawaida la chumba na mbali na unyevu. Afya hudumisha sakafu ya duka na stoo kati ya 15 na 25 °C na unyevu chini ya 65%. Vifaa vidogo vya kurekodi joto na unyevu hurekodi vyote viwili kila dakika 15 na hutoa king’ora iwapo chochote kati ya hivyo kitatoka nje ya kiwango; kiongozi wa duka hupitia king’ora chochote ndani ya saa 24. Iwapo bidhaa inahitaji kiwango tofauti, mfumo hukirekodi na bidhaa huhifadhiwa ipasavyo.", "Night work: the law treats work after 20:00 as night work and adds a premium of 5% of basic pay for each hour": "Kazi ya usiku: sheria inahesabu kazi inayofanywa baada ya 20:00 kuwa kazi ya usiku na inaongeza nyongeza ya 5% ya mshahara wa msingi kwa kila saa", "Night-work premium, 20:00 to 21:15": "Nyongeza ya kazi ya usiku, 20:00 hadi 21:15", "Not legal advice · each product’s classification is confirmed with TMDA, TBS and the Pharmacy Council before it is stocked · a Tanzanian regulatory lawyer reviews this list before launch": "Huu si ushauri wa kisheria · uainishaji wa kila bidhaa huthibitishwa na TMDA, TBS na Baraza la Famasi kabla ya kuwekwa dukani · mwanasheria wa masuala ya udhibiti wa Tanzania hupitia orodha hii kabla ya kuanza", "Once a month both founders read a one-page quality report produced by the system. It shows six numbers, each with a fixed target.": "Mara moja kwa mwezi waanzilishi wote wawili husoma ripoti ya ubora ya ukurasa mmoja inayotolewa na mfumo. Inaonyesha takwimu sita, kila moja ikiwa na lengo lisilobadilika.", "Orders placed after 15:00 are delivered the next morning.": "Oda zinazowekwa baada ya 15:00 husafirishwa asubuhi inayofuata.", "Other legal duties": "Majukumu mengine ya kisheria", "Pay in Dar es Salaam rises faster than planned.": "Mishahara Dar es Salaam inapanda kwa kasi kuliko ilivyopangwa.", "People are hired in the order the store needs them. The store lead starts two months before opening, to help with the fit-out, the supplier set-up, the first stock order and the hiring of the rest of the team. The advisers and the picker start three weeks before opening, and the riders two weeks before.": "Watu huajiriwa kwa mpangilio ambao duka linawahitaji. Kiongozi wa duka huanza miezi miwili kabla ya ufunguzi, ili kusaidia uwekaji wa samani na vifaa, maandalizi ya wasambazaji, oda ya kwanza ya bidhaa na kuajiri timu iliyobaki. Washauri na mchukuaji huanza wiki tatu kabla ya ufunguzi, na madereva wa pikipiki wiki mbili kabla.", "Per person": "Kwa kila mtu", "Picker and packer · 1 person · TSh 700,000 a month": "Mchukuaji na mfungaji · mtu 1 · TSh 700,000 kwa mwezi", "Picker and packer, three weeks before opening": "Mchukuaji na mfungaji, wiki tatu kabla ya ufunguzi", "Plus employer NSSF 10% and WCF 0.5%, paid by Afya": "Ongeza NSSF ya mwajiri 10% na WCF 0.5%, zinazolipwa na Afya", "Product registration costs Afya nothing at launch for a simple reason. An imported device must be registered with TMDA, which can take up to 240 days for Classes B to D": "Usajili wa bidhaa hauigharimu Afya chochote wakati wa kuanza kwa sababu rahisi. Kifaa kinachoingizwa kutoka nje lazima kisajiliwe na TMDA, jambo ambalo linaweza kuchukua hadi siku 240 kwa Daraja B hadi D", "Relief cover for 28 days of annual leave": "Mbadala wa likizo kwa likizo ya mwaka ya siku 28", "Rental equipment, such as walking frames and wheelchairs, is cleaned, inspected and logged between customers, with photographs of its condition and a signed handover record. After a device purchase or a red Afya Check reading, a follow-up call is scheduled for the adviser, with the customer’s consent.": "Vifaa vya kukodisha, kama fremu za kutembelea na viti vya magurudumu, husafishwa, hukaguliwa na hurekodiwa kati ya mteja mmoja na mwingine, pamoja na picha za hali yake na kumbukumbu ya makabidhiano iliyosainiwa. Baada ya ununuzi wa kifaa au kipimo chekundu cha Afya Check, simu ya ufuatiliaji hupangwa kwa ajili ya mshauri, kwa ridhaa ya mteja.", "Replacing a trained adviser costs roughly one month of their salary in recruitment and training time (a planning estimate), and members notice when the familiar face changes. Fair pay, regular feedback and a visible path to promotion are therefore part of the business plan, not extras.": "Kumbadilisha mshauri aliyefunzwa kunagharimu takriban mshahara wake wa mwezi mmoja katika muda wa kuajiri na kufundisha (makadirio ya mipango), na wanachama hugundua sura waliyoizoea inapobadilika. Kwa hiyo mshahara wa haki, mrejesho wa mara kwa mara na njia inayoonekana ya kupandishwa cheo ni sehemu ya mpango wa biashara, si nyongeza.", "Return rules are displayed at the counter and in the app: unopened, non-hygiene items can be returned; opened hygiene and medical items cannot, for safety reasons.": "Kanuni za urejeshaji zimebandikwa kaunta na kwenye programu: bidhaa ambazo hazijafunguliwa na zisizo za usafi zinaweza kurejeshwa; bidhaa za usafi na za matibabu zilizofunguliwa haziwezi kurejeshwa, kwa sababu za kiusalama.", "Riders · 2 people · TSh 600,000 a month each": "Madereva wa pikipiki · watu 2 · TSh 600,000 kwa mwezi kila mmoja", "Routine controls also slip without structure. A fridge temperature that should be written down twice a day, an expiry check that should happen weekly, a cash count that should be done by two people: each is easy to skip when nobody records who did it. In a business that sells health products, a skipped check is not a small mistake. It can mean an expired test strip reaching a diabetic customer.": "Udhibiti wa kawaida pia hulegea pasipo mfumo. Joto la jokofu linalopaswa kuandikwa mara mbili kwa siku, ukaguzi wa tarehe za mwisho wa matumizi unaopaswa kufanyika kila wiki, hesabu ya fedha inayopaswa kufanywa na watu wawili: kila kimoja ni rahisi kurukwa pale ambapo hakuna anayerekodi aliyekifanya. Katika biashara inayouza bidhaa za afya, ukaguzi uliorukwa si kosa dogo. Unaweza kumaanisha kipande cha kipimo kilichokwisha muda kumfikia mteja mwenye kisukari.", "Salaries": "Mishahara", "Set by type of business": "Huwekwa kulingana na aina ya biashara", "Shelves are faced and gaps noted for the morning order.": "Rafu hupangwa upya na mapengo hurekodiwa kwa ajili ya oda ya asubuhi.", "Six supplier gates (section 4.2), batch tracing, same-day contact with every affected customer and full disclosure of what happened limit the harm and protect trust.": "Vigezo sita vya msambazaji (sehemu ya 4.2), ufuatiliaji wa matoleo, mawasiliano ya siku hiyohiyo na kila mteja aliyeathirika na uwazi kamili kuhusu kilichotokea hupunguza madhara na kulinda imani.", "Social security (NSSF) is 20% of pay, normally split equally between employer and employee": "Hifadhi ya jamii (NSSF) ni 20% ya mshahara, kwa kawaida ikigawanywa sawa kati ya mwajiri na mfanyakazi", "Stock is issued first-expiry-first-out: the system always directs the picker to the batch that expires soonest, not to the one that arrived first. Afya’s rules are simple. A product with more than 90 days left is sold normally. Between 31 and 90 days it is moved to the front of the shelf and an alert is raised. A monthly Afya Box only ever contains products with more than 90 days left, so nothing expires in a member’s home before the next box arrives. At 30 days or less the product is pulled from sale automatically and returned to the supplier or destroyed, and the destruction is recorded.": "Bidhaa hutolewa kwa utaratibu wa kinachoisha muda kwanza hutoka kwanza: mfumo kila mara humwelekeza mchukuaji kwenye toleo litakaloisha muda mapema zaidi, si lile lililowasili kwanza. Kanuni za Afya ni rahisi. Bidhaa yenye zaidi ya siku 90 zilizobaki huuzwa kama kawaida. Kati ya siku 31 na 90 huhamishiwa mbele ya rafu na tahadhari hutolewa. Afya Box ya kila mwezi huwa na bidhaa zenye zaidi ya siku 90 zilizobaki pekee, hivyo hakuna kinachoisha muda nyumbani kwa mwanachama kabla boksi linalofuata halijawasili. Zikibaki siku 30 au chini ya hapo, bidhaa huondolewa kwenye mauzo kiotomatiki na kurejeshwa kwa msambazaji au kuteketezwa, na uteketezaji huo hurekodiwa.", "Stock.": "Bidhaa.", "Store lead, from two months before opening": "Kiongozi wa duka, kuanzia miezi miwili kabla ya ufunguzi", "Supplier approval is described in section 4.2: the supplier’s licence is checked, each product’s registration is confirmed against TMDA’s public register or TBS’s certificate, samples are inspected and references are taken. Only approved suppliers can be selected when a purchase order is raised.": "Uidhinishaji wa msambazaji umeelezwa katika sehemu ya 4.2: leseni ya msambazaji hukaguliwa, usajili wa kila bidhaa huthibitishwa dhidi ya rejista ya umma ya TMDA au cheti cha TBS, sampuli hukaguliwa na maoni ya wadhamini huchukuliwa. Ni wasambazaji walioidhinishwa pekee wanaoweza kuchaguliwa wakati oda ya ununuzi inapoandaliwa.", "TBS, the Tanzania Bureau of Standards,": "TBS, Shirika la Viwango Tanzania,", "TMDA (medical devices)": "TMDA (vifaa tiba)", "TMDA sets deadlines by risk. A Class I recall, the most serious, must be completed within 14 days; Class II within 21 days; and Class III within 30 days. A recalled product may not be sold, offered or displayed": "TMDA huweka muda wa mwisho kulingana na kiwango cha hatari. Urejeshaji wa bidhaa wa Daraja I, ulio mzito zaidi, lazima ukamilike ndani ya siku 14; Daraja II ndani ya siku 21; na Daraja III ndani ya siku 30. Bidhaa iliyorejeshwa hairuhusiwi kuuzwa, kutolewa wala kuonyeshwa", "TMDA, the Tanzania Medicines and Medical Devices Authority,": "TMDA, Mamlaka ya Dawa na Vifaa Tiba Tanzania,", "Tanzania’s new minimum wage order came into force on 1 January 2026": "Amri mpya ya kima cha chini cha mshahara ya Tanzania ilianza kutumika tarehe 1 Januari 2026", "Tap 1: scan the supplier barcode on the carton. The handheld shows the purchase order line it belongs to. Tap 2: scan the batch and expiry on one pack; the system checks the expiry against the rule and the batch against any recall. Tap 3: confirm the quantity. Stock is updated, the batch is linked to every future sale of those strips, and the supplier’s invoice is matched. Three taps replace a page of handwritten records.": "Mguso 1: skani msimbo pau wa msambazaji kwenye katoni. Kifaa cha mkononi huonyesha kipengele cha oda ya ununuzi kinachohusika. Mguso 2: skani toleo na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi kwenye pakiti moja; mfumo hukagua tarehe dhidi ya kanuni na toleo dhidi ya urejeshaji wowote wa bidhaa. Mguso 3: thibitisha idadi. Bidhaa zilizopo husasishwa, toleo huunganishwa na kila mauzo ya baadaye ya vipande hivyo, na ankara ya msambazaji huoanishwa. Miguso mitatu huchukua nafasi ya ukurasa mzima wa kumbukumbu za kuandika kwa mkono.", "Temperature or humidity alarms not reviewed within 24 hours": "Ving’ora vya joto au unyevu ambavyo havijapitiwa ndani ya saa 24", "The PDPC, the Personal Data Protection Commission,": "PDPC, Tume ya Ulinzi wa Taarifa Binafsi,", "The Pharmacy Council": "Baraza la Famasi", "The advisers are the people most customers meet. They run the Afya Check kiosk and explain the results, advise on the shop floor, enrol members into the Afya Box, and answer WhatsApp messages within five minutes during opening hours. They work in pairs: two on an early shift and two on a late shift. All four are trained across every Care Zone, and each also specialises: two in mother and baby, two in heart, diabetes and senior care.": "Washauri ndio watu ambao wateja wengi hukutana nao. Huendesha kibanda cha Afya Check na kueleza matokeo, hutoa ushauri sakafuni mwa duka, husajili wanachama wa Afya Box, na hujibu ujumbe wa WhatsApp ndani ya dakika tano katika saa za kazi. Hufanya kazi kwa jozi: wawili kwenye zamu ya asubuhi na wawili kwenye zamu ya jioni. Wote wanne wamefunzwa katika kila Care Zone, na kila mmoja pia ana utaalamu maalum: wawili katika mama na mtoto, wawili katika moyo, kisukari na huduma kwa wazee.", "The after-work peak: office workers collecting click-and-collect orders, checks and quick purchases.": "Kilele cha baada ya kazi: wafanyakazi wa ofisini wanaochukua oda walizoagiza mtandaoni, vipimo na manunuzi ya haraka.", "The agreement is suspended the same day, and a second licensed pharmacy is kept on standby under the same terms. If riders may not carry the sealed bag, customers collect it from the pharmacy and Afya delivers only its own products.": "Makubaliano husitishwa siku hiyohiyo, na duka la pili la dawa lenye leseni huwekwa tayari kwa masharti yaleyale. Iwapo madereva wa pikipiki hawaruhusiwi kubeba mfuko uliofungwa, wateja huuchukua kutoka duka la dawa na Afya husafirisha bidhaa zake pekee.", "The alternative, opening Afya’s own pharmacy counter, would require registering the store as a pharmacy, employing a pharmacist in charge and meeting the licensing rules on premises, which have included a minimum distance from existing pharmacies": "Njia mbadala, yaani kufungua kaunta ya dawa ya Afya yenyewe, ingehitaji kusajili duka kama duka la dawa, kuajiri mfamasia mkuu na kutimiza kanuni za leseni kuhusu jengo, ambazo zimekuwa zikijumuisha umbali wa chini kutoka maduka ya dawa yaliyopo", "The early pair of advisers take the floor and the kiosk. The picker starts packing the day’s Afya Boxes from the system’s list, scanning every item and photographing every finished box.": "Jozi ya asubuhi ya washauri inashika sakafu ya duka na kibanda. Mchukuaji anaanza kufungasha Afya Box za siku kutoka orodha ya mfumo, akiskani kila bidhaa na kupiga picha kila boksi lililokamilika.", "The factor 1.105 adds the employer’s 10% NSSF and 0.5% WCF contributions. Because the real cost is about TSh 9 million, the seed line has been raised to TSh 9 million and the working-capital reserve lowered by TSh 1 million, so the TSh 340 million total is unchanged. Uniform, first-aid course and advertising prices are planning estimates to be confirmed with suppliers.": "Kizidisho 1.105 kinaongeza michango ya mwajiri ya NSSF 10% na WCF 0.5%. Kwa kuwa gharama halisi ni takriban TSh milioni 9, kipengele cha mtaji wa mwanzo kimepandishwa hadi TSh milioni 9 na akiba ya mtaji wa uendeshaji imepunguzwa kwa TSh milioni 1, hivyo jumla ya TSh milioni 340 haibadiliki. Bei za sare, kozi ya huduma ya kwanza na matangazo ni makadirio ya mipango yatakayothibitishwa na wasambazaji.", "The flagship store is run by eight employed people: one store lead, four health advisers, one picker and packer, and two riders. Together they keep a 180 m² store open twelve hours a day, seven days a week, run the free Afya Check, pack every Afya Box and online order, and deliver across Dar es Salaam the same day.": "Duka kuu huendeshwa na watu wanane walioajiriwa: kiongozi mmoja wa duka, washauri wa afya wanne, mchukuaji na mfungaji mmoja, na madereva wa pikipiki wawili. Kwa pamoja huweka duka la 180 m² wazi saa kumi na mbili kwa siku, siku saba kwa wiki, huendesha huduma ya bure ya Afya Check, hufungasha kila Afya Box na oda ya mtandaoni, na husafirisha kote Dar es Salaam siku hiyohiyo.", "The float is counted by two people at opening and at closing, and both sign. Cash above the float is banked every day through a bank agent, and the deposit slip is photographed into the system. Any difference, however small, is recorded with a reason and reviewed by the store lead the next morning.": "Fedha za kuanzia kaunta huhesabiwa na watu wawili wakati wa kufungua na kufunga, na wote wawili husaini. Fedha taslimu zinazozidi kiasi hicho huwekwa benki kila siku kupitia wakala wa benki, na hati ya kuweka fedha hupigwa picha na kuingizwa kwenye mfumo. Tofauti yoyote, hata ndogo kiasi gani, hurekodiwa pamoja na sababu na kupitiwa na kiongozi wa duka asubuhi inayofuata.", "The handheld follows one design rule: any routine task takes three taps or fewer. The reason is practical. Every extra step is a chance to make a mistake, adds training time, and takes the adviser away from the customer.": "Kifaa cha mkononi kinafuata kanuni moja ya muundo: kazi yoyote ya kawaida huchukua miguso mitatu au michache zaidi. Sababu ni ya kivitendo. Kila hatua ya ziada ni nafasi ya kufanya kosa, huongeza muda wa mafunzo, na humwondoa mshauri kwa mteja.", "The last same-day deliveries leave.": "Usafirishaji wa mwisho wa siku hiyohiyo unaondoka.", "The late pair arrive. Open WhatsApp conversations, follow-up calls and red Afya Check readings are handed over on the handheld.": "Jozi ya jioni inawasili. Mazungumzo ya WhatsApp yaliyo wazi, simu za ufuatiliaji na vipimo vyekundu vya Afya Check hukabidhiwa kupitia kifaa cha mkononi.", "The master model sets aside TSh 500,000 a month, TSh 6 million a year, for insurance and licences. The fees that are published are small compared with that amount:": "Modeli kuu inatenga TSh 500,000 kwa mwezi, TSh milioni 6 kwa mwaka, kwa bima na leseni. Ada zilizochapishwa ni ndogo ukilinganisha na kiasi hicho:", "The monthly employment cost of this team, with leave cover and contributions, is TSh 5,831,000. Its pre-opening hiring and training is calculated the same way as for the flagship: the store lead one month before opening (TSh 1,657,500), three advisers and the picker two weeks before (TSh 1,491,750 and TSh 386,750), uniforms (TSh 450,000), first-aid certificates (TSh 300,000) and adverts (TSh 200,000), a total of TSh 4,486,000. Its seed line is therefore TSh 4.5 million, with the reserve lowered by TSh 0.5 million so the TSh 150 million total does not change.": "Gharama ya ajira ya kila mwezi ya timu hii, ikijumuisha mbadala wa likizo na michango, ni TSh 5,831,000. Gharama zake za kuajiri na mafunzo kabla ya ufunguzi zinakokotolewa kwa njia ileile kama ya duka kuu: kiongozi wa duka mwezi mmoja kabla ya ufunguzi (TSh 1,657,500), washauri watatu na mchukuaji wiki mbili kabla (TSh 1,491,750 na TSh 386,750), sare (TSh 450,000), vyeti vya huduma ya kwanza (TSh 300,000) na matangazo (TSh 200,000), jumla ya TSh 4,486,000. Kwa hiyo kipengele chake cha mtaji wa mwanzo ni TSh milioni 4.5, na akiba imepunguzwa kwa TSh milioni 0.5 ili jumla ya TSh milioni 150 isibadilike.", "The partner pharmacy loses its licence, or the courier step is not approved.": "Duka la dawa mshirika linapoteza leseni yake, au hatua ya usafirishaji haiidhinishwi.", "The picker and a second person receive the delivery: count, batch, expiry and pack condition are checked against the purchase order. Anything short-dated or damaged is refused at the door.": "Mchukuaji na mtu wa pili wanapokea mzigo: idadi, toleo, tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi na hali ya pakiti hukaguliwa dhidi ya oda ya ununuzi. Chochote chenye muda mfupi wa matumizi uliobaki au kilichoharibika hukataliwa mlangoni.", "The picker and packer prepares every Afya Box and online order, photographs each box before it is sealed, prepares click-and-collect orders within two hours, and receives deliveries from suppliers. At every delivery they check, together with a second person, that the quantity, the batch number and the expiry date match the purchase order. This is the most process-driven job in the store, and the one where a single mistake reaches a customer’s home, which is why every step is scanned.": "Mchukuaji na mfungaji huandaa kila Afya Box na oda ya mtandaoni, hupiga picha kila boksi kabla ya kufungwa, huandaa oda za kuchukua dukani ndani ya saa mbili, na hupokea mizigo kutoka kwa wasambazaji. Katika kila mzigo, yeye pamoja na mtu wa pili hukagua kwamba idadi, namba ya toleo (batch) na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi vinalingana na oda ya ununuzi. Hii ndiyo kazi inayotegemea taratibu zaidi dukani, na ndiyo ambayo kosa moja hufika nyumbani kwa mteja, ndiyo sababu kila hatua huskaniwa.", "The procedures are grouped by time: opening (eight steps, from unlocking to opening the doors at 09:00), during the day (deliveries, receiving, fridge log if needed, follow-up calls), closing (facing shelves, cash-up, report), and weekly (stock counts, expiry review, cleaning of rental equipment, checking that every licence is in date).": "Taratibu zimepangwa kwa muda: ufunguzi (hatua nane, kuanzia kufungua kufuli hadi kufungua milango saa 09:00), wakati wa mchana (usafirishaji, upokeaji wa bidhaa, kumbukumbu ya jokofu inapohitajika, simu za ufuatiliaji), kufunga (kupanga rafu, kuhesabu fedha za siku, ripoti), na kila wiki (hesabu za bidhaa, mapitio ya tarehe za mwisho wa matumizi, usafishaji wa vifaa vya kukodisha, kuhakiki kwamba kila leseni iko ndani ya muda wake).", "The product list below shows the status of each type of product. Select one to see the regulator, Afya’s rule and an example.": "Orodha ya bidhaa hapa chini inaonyesha hali ya kila aina ya bidhaa. Chagua moja kuona mdhibiti, kanuni ya Afya na mfano.", "The rest of the TSh 6 million covers insurance for the stock, the premises and public liability, and the fees that are set at inspection. The TMDA permit fee shown is from the most recent published fee schedule found (October 2011) and is confirmed with TMDA before filing.": "Kiasi kilichobaki cha TSh milioni 6 kinagharamia bima ya bidhaa, jengo na dhima kwa umma, pamoja na ada zinazowekwa wakati wa ukaguzi. Ada ya kibali cha TMDA iliyoonyeshwa inatoka kwenye jedwali la ada lililochapishwa hivi karibuni zaidi lililopatikana (Oktoba 2011) na huthibitishwa na TMDA kabla ya kuwasilisha maombi.", "The riders deliver on electric motorbikes in three waves a day, at 10:00, 13:00 and 16:00. At every door they confirm the handover with a four-digit code sent to the customer and a photograph. Riders are employed, uniformed and trained in road safety and in how to hand over a health product politely. For many members the rider is the only Afya employee they ever meet, so the rider is part of the brand, not an outside courier.": "Madereva wa pikipiki husafirisha kwa pikipiki za umeme katika mizunguko mitatu kwa siku, saa 10:00, 13:00 na 16:00. Katika kila mlango huthibitisha makabidhiano kwa msimbo wa tarakimu nne unaotumwa kwa mteja na kwa picha. Madereva wa pikipiki ni waajiriwa, huvaa sare na wamefunzwa usalama barabarani na jinsi ya kukabidhi bidhaa ya afya kwa adabu. Kwa wanachama wengi, dereva wa pikipiki ndiye mfanyakazi pekee wa Afya wanayekutana naye, hivyo dereva ni sehemu ya chapa, si msafirishaji wa nje.", "The riders leave with the morning orders and boxes. Each handover is confirmed with the customer’s code and a photo; the system shows the customer’s order as delivered within seconds.": "Madereva wa pikipiki wanaondoka na oda na maboksi ya asubuhi. Kila makabidhiano huthibitishwa kwa msimbo wa mteja na picha; mfumo huonyesha oda ya mteja kuwa imefikishwa ndani ya sekunde chache.", "The rules themselves are strict and split between several regulators. Medicines, medical devices, cosmetics and personal data each have their own authority. Selling medicinal products outside registered premises is an offence that can bring a fine of up to TSh 10 million, two years in prison, or both": "Kanuni zenyewe ni kali na zimegawanywa kati ya wadhibiti kadhaa. Dawa, vifaa tiba, vipodozi na taarifa binafsi kila kimoja kina mamlaka yake. Kuuza bidhaa za dawa nje ya jengo lililosajiliwa ni kosa linaloweza kuleta faini ya hadi TSh milioni 10, kifungo cha miaka miwili gerezani, au vyote viwili", "The salaries are benchmarked again before hiring. A 10% rise across the team would add about TSh 0.8 million a month to costs.": "Mishahara hulinganishwa tena na viwango vya soko kabla ya kuajiri. Ongezeko la 10% kwa timu nzima lingeongeza takriban TSh milioni 0.8 kwa mwezi kwenye gharama.", "The salary of TSh 1.5 million is about six times the legal minimum for the health sector (TSh 240,000). It is set at that level because the store lead is the one person whose departure would hurt most, and because the same person is expected to open and run the second store in year 2.": "Mshahara wa TSh milioni 1.5 ni takriban mara sita ya kima cha chini cha mshahara kwa sekta ya afya (TSh 240,000). Umewekwa katika kiwango hicho kwa sababu kiongozi wa duka ndiye mtu ambaye kuondoka kwake kungeleta madhara makubwa zaidi, na kwa sababu mtu huyohuyo anatarajiwa kufungua na kuendesha duka la pili katika mwaka wa 2.", "The same steps apply to every role. A rider on TSh 600,000 pays TSh 60,000 NSSF and TSh 24,000 PAYE, and takes home TSh 516,000.": "Hatua zilezile hutumika kwa kila nafasi. Dereva wa pikipiki mwenye mshahara wa TSh 600,000 hulipa NSSF ya TSh 60,000 na PAYE ya TSh 24,000, na hupokea TSh 516,000.", "The seed money set aside for this was previously a round TSh 8 million. It has now been calculated line by line:": "Fedha za mtaji wa mwanzo zilizotengwa kwa jambo hili hapo awali zilikuwa kiasi cha kukadiria cha TSh milioni 8. Sasa zimekokotolewa kipengele kwa kipengele:", "The stockroom holds four batches: B-2603 expiring on 22 November 2026, B-2607 on 10 December 2026, B-2609 on 20 January 2027 and B-2604 on 30 August 2027. On 1 November, B-2603 has 21 days left, so the system has already pulled it from sale and listed it for return. B-2607 has 39 days left: it is sold first in the store, from the front of the shelf, but it cannot go into a monthly box. B-2609 has 80 days left and is also front-of-shelf only. B-2604, with 302 days left, is the only batch that goes into monthly boxes. A first-in-first-out system would have picked B-2603, the oldest delivery, and sold an almost-expired pack.": "Stoo ina matoleo manne: B-2603 linaloisha muda tarehe 22 Novemba 2026, B-2607 tarehe 10 Desemba 2026, B-2609 tarehe 20 Januari 2027 na B-2604 tarehe 30 Agosti 2027. Tarehe 1 Novemba, B-2603 limebakiza siku 21, hivyo mfumo umekwisha kuliondoa kwenye mauzo na kuliorodhesha kurejeshwa. B-2607 limebakiza siku 39: linauzwa kwanza dukani, kutoka mbele ya rafu, lakini haliwezi kuwekwa kwenye boksi la kila mwezi. B-2609 limebakiza siku 80 na pia linauzwa mbele ya rafu pekee. B-2604, likiwa na siku 302 zilizobaki, ndilo toleo pekee linalowekwa kwenye maboksi ya kila mwezi. Mfumo wa kilichoingia kwanza hutoka kwanza ungechagua B-2603, mzigo wa zamani zaidi, na kuuza pakiti iliyokaribia kwisha muda.", "The store is open from 09:00 to 21:00 every day: 84 hours a week. The rule is that two people are on the shop floor at all times, so that one can run the Afya Check while the other serves customers and answers WhatsApp. The rota also has to respect three limits in Tanzanian law: an ordinary week of no more than 45 hours, overtime paid at one and a half times, and a weekly rest day": "Duka hufunguliwa kuanzia 09:00 hadi 21:00 kila siku: saa 84 kwa wiki. Kanuni ni kwamba watu wawili huwa sakafuni mwa duka wakati wote, ili mmoja aendeshe Afya Check huku mwingine akihudumia wateja na kujibu WhatsApp. Ratiba ya zamu pia inapaswa kuheshimu mipaka mitatu ya sheria ya Tanzania: wiki ya kawaida isiyozidi saa 45, saa za ziada kulipwa mara moja na nusu, na siku ya mapumziko kila wiki", "The store lead runs the store and the team. They approve purchase orders, resolve complaints, sign the daily cash-up, lead the Afya Check and are the person a regulator or inspector speaks to. A physiotherapy graduate is preferred, for a practical reason: a large share of questions in the Mobility & Recovery and Seniors zones are about movement, pain, falls and devices such as walking frames and wheelchairs. Clinical training gives the store lead sound judgement about when a customer should be sent to a doctor rather than sold a product.": "Kiongozi wa duka huendesha duka na timu. Huidhinisha oda za ununuzi, hutatua malalamiko, husaini hesabu ya fedha za kila siku, huongoza huduma ya Afya Check na ndiye mtu ambaye mdhibiti au mkaguzi huzungumza naye. Mhitimu wa fiziotherapia hupewa kipaumbele, kwa sababu ya kivitendo: sehemu kubwa ya maswali katika maeneo ya Mobility & Recovery na Seniors yanahusu kutembea, maumivu, kuanguka na vifaa kama fremu za kutembelea na viti vya magurudumu. Mafunzo ya kitabibu humpa kiongozi wa duka uamuzi thabiti kuhusu ni lini mteja anapaswa kupelekwa kwa daktari badala ya kuuziwa bidhaa.", "The store lead · 1 person · TSh 1,500,000 a month": "Kiongozi wa duka · mtu 1 · TSh 1,500,000 kwa mwezi", "The table shows the monthly cost of the team as it is entered in the master model. It has five parts: the salaries, cover for annual leave, the employer’s social security and workers’ compensation contributions, and the premium for night work.": "Jedwali linaonyesha gharama ya kila mwezi ya timu kama ilivyoingizwa kwenye modeli kuu. Lina sehemu tano: mishahara, mbadala wa likizo ya mwaka, michango ya mwajiri ya hifadhi ya jamii na ya fidia kwa wafanyakazi, na nyongeza ya kazi ya usiku.", "The two people on the early shift unlock, disarm the alarm and switch on the lights and screens. They count the cash float together and both sign on the handheld. The Afya Check kiosk is cleaned and a test reading is taken to confirm it is working. The Care Zones are walked for gaps and wrong price labels. The handheld shows today’s deliveries, the list of boxes to pack and any low-stock alerts. About fifteen minutes.": "Watu wawili wa zamu ya asubuhi hufungua kufuli, huzima king’ora na huwasha taa na skrini. Huhesabu pamoja fedha za kuanzia kaunta na wote wawili husaini kwenye kifaa cha mkononi. Kibanda cha Afya Check husafishwa na kipimo cha majaribio huchukuliwa kuthibitisha kwamba kinafanya kazi. Care Zones hukaguliwa kwa mapengo na lebo za bei zisizo sahihi. Kifaa cha mkononi huonyesha mizigo inayotarajiwa leo, orodha ya maboksi ya kufungasha na tahadhari zozote za bidhaa zinazopungua. Takriban dakika kumi na tano.", "The written agreement covers five points. The pharmacy keeps its premises permit and its pharmacist’s registration current and sends copies every June; if either lapses, the agreement is suspended the same day. The pharmacy pays Afya a fixed fee for each sealed bag delivered; the amount is to be agreed and the financial model counts none of it, so any fee is extra income. Customer details are shared only with the customer’s consent, under the data-protection law. The customer is free to use any pharmacy. And before launch, a Tanzanian regulatory lawyer and the Pharmacy Council confirm that Afya’s riders may carry the sealed bag; if they may not, the customer collects the bag from the pharmacy and Afya delivers only its own products.": "Makubaliano ya maandishi yanahusu mambo matano. Duka la dawa huhakikisha kibali chake cha jengo na usajili wa mfamasia wake viko hai na hutuma nakala kila Juni; iwapo chochote kati ya hivyo kitakwisha muda, makubaliano husitishwa siku hiyohiyo. Duka la dawa hulipa Afya ada maalum kwa kila mfuko uliofungwa unaowasilishwa; kiasi kitakubaliwa na modeli ya kifedha haihesabu chochote kati yake, hivyo ada yoyote ni mapato ya ziada. Taarifa za mteja hushirikishwa kwa ridhaa ya mteja pekee, chini ya sheria ya ulinzi wa taarifa binafsi. Mteja yuko huru kutumia duka lolote la dawa. Na kabla ya kuanza, mwanasheria wa masuala ya udhibiti wa Tanzania na Baraza la Famasi huthibitisha kwamba madereva wa pikipiki wa Afya wanaruhusiwa kubeba mfuko uliofungwa; iwapo hawaruhusiwi, mteja huchukua mfuko kutoka duka la dawa na Afya husafirisha bidhaa zake pekee.", "This is the most important compliance decision in the business, and it has been made. Afya Basics sells medical devices and diagnostics, first-aid supplies, hygiene products, mother-and-baby products, mobility aids and cosmetics. It does not sell, dispense or take payment for any medicine, including simple ones such as paracetamol or oral rehydration salts, because the Pharmacy Act contains no general exception for over-the-counter medicines": "Huu ndio uamuzi muhimu zaidi wa uzingatiaji wa sheria katika biashara, na umekwisha kufanywa. Afya Basics huuza vifaa tiba na vifaa vya vipimo, vifaa vya huduma ya kwanza, bidhaa za usafi, bidhaa za mama na mtoto, vifaa vya kusaidia kutembea na vipodozi. Haiuzi, haitoi wala haipokei malipo ya dawa yoyote, zikiwemo dawa rahisi kama paracetamol au chumvi za kurejesha maji mwilini, kwa sababu Sheria ya Famasi haina msamaha wa jumla kwa dawa zinazouzwa bila cheti cha daktari", "This section explains which authorities regulate which products, what Afya Basics is allowed to sell and why it does not sell medicines itself, how a product earns its place on the shelf, how stock is kept safe and in date, what happens when a customer complains or a product is recalled, which licences the business needs and when they are renewed, and what all of this costs. Compliance here is not only a cost: in a market where about one medical product in ten is substandard or falsified": "Sehemu hii inaeleza ni mamlaka zipi zinazodhibiti bidhaa zipi, kile ambacho Afya Basics inaruhusiwa kuuza na kwa nini haiuzi dawa yenyewe, jinsi bidhaa inavyostahili nafasi yake kwenye rafu, jinsi bidhaa zinavyohifadhiwa salama na ndani ya muda wa matumizi, kinachotokea mteja anapolalamika au bidhaa inaporejeshwa, leseni ambazo biashara inahitaji na lini huhuishwa, na gharama ya yote haya. Hapa uzingatiaji wa sheria si gharama tu: katika soko ambalo takriban bidhaa moja kati ya kumi za matibabu ni duni au bandia", "This section explains who does what, how the hours are covered, what a normal day looks like, how the team is hired and trained, what they are paid and why, how the law on pay and working hours is met, and how cash and stock are protected. The full cost of the team, including every contribution the law requires, is TSh 8,349,400 a month, about 7.3% of the store’s revenue in month 12 of the base case.": "Sehemu hii inaeleza nani anafanya nini, jinsi saa za kazi zinavyofidiwa, siku ya kawaida inavyokuwa, jinsi timu inavyoajiriwa na kufundishwa, wanacholipwa na kwa nini, jinsi sheria kuhusu mishahara na saa za kazi inavyozingatiwa, na jinsi fedha na bidhaa zinavyolindwa. Gharama kamili ya timu, ikijumuisha kila mchango unaotakiwa na sheria, ni TSh 8,349,400 kwa mwezi, takriban 7.3% ya mapato ya duka katika mwezi wa 12 wa hali ya msingi.", "Time-stamped checklists, two-person cash counts and the 21:00 report showing every missed task mean the founders know the same evening, wherever they are.": "Orodha za ukaguzi zenye muda uliorekodiwa, hesabu za fedha zinazofanywa na watu wawili na ripoti ya 21:00 inayoonyesha kila kazi iliyokosekana humaanisha kwamba waanzilishi hujua jioni hiyohiyo, popote walipo.", "Total cost to Afya Basics": "Jumla ya gharama kwa Afya Basics", "Training lasts four weeks. Week 1 is the Afya Way: the brand, the customer charter, and privacy and consent under the Personal Data Protection Act. Week 2 is the system: the till, scan-and-go, mobile money, stock and batches, members and boxes. Week 3 is health advice: how to explain Afya Check readings, when to refer a customer to a clinic, product knowledge for each Care Zone, and every employee’s first-aid certificate. Week 4 is supervised shifts after the soft opening, a written test on the procedures, role-plays, and sign-off by the store lead. After that, a 30-minute training session is held every week.": "Mafunzo huchukua wiki nne. Wiki ya 1 ni Njia ya Afya: chapa, mkataba wa huduma kwa wateja, na faragha na ridhaa chini ya Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Taarifa Binafsi. Wiki ya 2 ni mfumo: kaunta ya malipo, kuskani na kuondoka, pesa za simu, bidhaa na matoleo, wanachama na maboksi. Wiki ya 3 ni ushauri wa afya: jinsi ya kueleza vipimo vya Afya Check, lini kumpeleka mteja kliniki, ujuzi wa bidhaa kwa kila Care Zone, na cheti cha huduma ya kwanza cha kila mfanyakazi. Wiki ya 4 ni zamu zinazosimamiwa baada ya ufunguzi wa majaribio, mtihani wa maandishi kuhusu taratibu, maigizo, na idhini ya mwisho ya kiongozi wa duka. Baada ya hapo, kipindi cha mafunzo cha dakika 30 hufanyika kila wiki.", "Two functions are bought in. An outsourced accountant prepares the monthly accounts, the tax returns and the payroll from data the system exports, and IT support is on call. At one store, both are cheaper and safer to buy than to employ. The third outside party is the licensed partner pharmacy. Afya Basics does not sell medicines, because Tanzanian law allows medicines to be sold only from premises registered with the Pharmacy Council and run by a registered pharmacist": "Kazi mbili hununuliwa kutoka nje. Mhasibu wa nje huandaa hesabu za kila mwezi, ritani za kodi na mishahara kutokana na takwimu zinazotolewa na mfumo, na huduma ya TEHAMA hupatikana inapohitajika. Kwa duka moja, zote mbili ni nafuu zaidi na salama zaidi kununua kuliko kuajiri. Mhusika wa tatu wa nje ni duka la dawa mshirika lenye leseni. Afya Basics haiuzi dawa, kwa sababu sheria ya Tanzania inaruhusu dawa kuuzwa tu kutoka jengo lililosajiliwa na Baraza la Famasi na linaloendeshwa na mfamasia aliyesajiliwa", "Two people count the cash; mobile-money and card payments have already been matched to sales by the system. The day’s report is generated automatically: sales, members enrolled, checks done, deliveries completed and every checklist item not ticked on time. The founders read it each night.": "Watu wawili huhesabu fedha taslimu; malipo ya pesa ya simu na ya kadi tayari yameoanishwa na mauzo na mfumo. Ripoti ya siku huzalishwa kiotomatiki: mauzo, wanachama waliosajiliwa, vipimo vilivyofanyika, usafirishaji uliokamilika na kila kipengele cha orodha ya ukaguzi ambacho hakikuwekewa tiki kwa wakati. Waanzilishi huisoma kila usiku.", "Two people in the store on two six-hour shifts a day, seven days a week, means 28 shifts a week. The three advisers work six shifts each, with one rest day: 18 shifts and 36 hours a week each. The store lead covers five shifts and the picker, who packs boxes in the store, covers the other five: 18 + 5 + 5 = 28. Nobody works more than 45 hours.": "Watu wawili dukani katika zamu mbili za saa sita kwa siku, siku saba kwa wiki, humaanisha zamu 28 kwa wiki. Washauri watatu hufanya zamu sita kila mmoja, pamoja na siku moja ya mapumziko: zamu 18 na saa 36 kwa wiki kila mmoja. Kiongozi wa duka hufidia zamu tano na mchukuaji, anayefungasha maboksi dukani, hufidia zamu nyingine tano: 18 + 5 + 5 = 28. Hakuna anayefanya kazi zaidi ya saa 45.", "Two people on each of two shifts, seven days a week, means 2 × 2 × 7 = 28 shifts to fill every week. Each of the four advisers works six shifts, three early and three late, with one full day of rest: 4 × 6 = 24 shifts. Their hours are 3 × 6.75 + 3 × 6.5 = 39.75 hours a week, comfortably inside the 45-hour limit, with no overtime. The remaining 4 shifts are covered by the store lead, who works as the second person on the floor on four early shifts a week and spends the fifth working day on suppliers, banking and paperwork. The store lead’s week is 45 hours.": "Watu wawili katika kila moja ya zamu mbili, siku saba kwa wiki, humaanisha zamu 2 × 2 × 7 = 28 za kujaza kila wiki. Kila mmoja wa washauri wanne hufanya zamu sita, tatu za asubuhi na tatu za jioni, pamoja na siku moja kamili ya mapumziko: zamu 4 × 6 = 24. Saa zao ni 3 × 6.75 + 3 × 6.5 = saa 39.75 kwa wiki, ndani ya kikomo cha saa 45 kwa nafasi, bila saa za ziada. Zamu 4 zilizobaki hufidiwa na kiongozi wa duka, anayefanya kazi kama mtu wa pili sakafuni katika zamu nne za asubuhi kwa wiki na hutumia siku ya tano ya kazi kushughulikia wasambazaji, benki na makaratasi. Wiki ya kiongozi wa duka ni saa 45.", "Two riders, two weeks before opening": "Madereva wawili wa pikipiki, wiki mbili kabla ya ufunguzi", "When a delivery arrives, the picker and a second person check it at the door against the purchase order.": "Mzigo unapowasili, mchukuaji na mtu wa pili huukagua mlangoni dhidi ya oda ya ununuzi.", "When the store lead is not in the building, which is every late shift and two full days a week, a senior adviser is named as duty manager. The duty manager holds the keys, signs the cash-up, approves any refund and can stop a sale. The picker works 45 hours over five days, mostly in the morning and early afternoon when the boxes are packed, and the riders work 45 hours each, built around the three delivery waves.": "Kiongozi wa duka asipokuwepo jengoni, yaani kila zamu ya jioni na siku mbili kamili kwa wiki, mshauri mwandamizi huteuliwa kuwa meneja wa zamu. Meneja wa zamu hushika funguo, husaini hesabu ya fedha za siku, huidhinisha marejesho yoyote ya fedha na anaweza kusimamisha mauzo. Mchukuaji hufanya kazi saa 45 kwa siku tano, hasa asubuhi na mapema mchana maboksi yanapofungashwa, na madereva wa pikipiki hufanya kazi saa 45 kila mmoja, zilizopangwa kuzunguka mizunguko mitatu ya usafirishaji.", "Who is not on the payroll, and why": "Nani hayumo kwenye orodha ya mishahara, na kwa nini", "Why leave cover and night work are in the model": "Kwa nini mbadala wa likizo na kazi ya usiku vimo kwenye modeli", "Worked example · building the weekly rota": "Mfano wa hesabu · kuandaa ratiba ya zamu ya wiki", "Worked example · four batches of glucose test strips": "Mfano wa hesabu · matoleo manne ya vipande vya kupima sukari", "Worked example · one adviser’s payslip": "Mfano wa hesabu · hati ya mshahara ya mshauri mmoja", "Worked example · the rota in the smaller store": "Mfano wa hesabu · ratiba ya zamu katika duka dogo zaidi", "and starts registering any preferred brands as soon as the company is formed.": "na huanza kusajili chapa zozote inazopendelea mara tu kampuni inapoundwa.", "for example some supplements or mobility aids. The product stays off the shelf until TMDA or TBS confirms its classification in writing.": "kwa mfano baadhi ya virutubisho au vifaa vya kusaidia kutembea. Bidhaa hubaki nje ya rafu hadi TMDA au TBS ithibitishe uainishaji wake kwa maandishi.", "registers every business that collects personal data. Health data, such as an Afya Check reading, is sensitive personal data and needs the customer’s explicit consent": "husajili kila biashara inayokusanya taarifa binafsi. Taarifa za afya, kama kipimo cha Afya Check, ni taarifa binafsi nyeti na zinahitaji ridhaa ya wazi ya mteja", "registers medicines, medical devices and diagnostics, licenses the premises that store and sell them, issues import permits, receives safety reports and manages recalls": "husajili dawa, vifaa tiba na vifaa vya vipimo, hutoa leseni kwa majengo yanayozihifadhi na kuziuza, hutoa vibali vya kuingiza bidhaa kutoka nje, hupokea taarifa za usalama na husimamia urejeshaji wa bidhaa", "registers pharmacy premises and pharmacists. Under the Pharmacy Act, medicinal products may be sold only from registered premises with a permit, and each retail pharmacy must be run by a registered pharmacist in charge": "husajili majengo ya maduka ya dawa na wafamasia. Chini ya Sheria ya Famasi, bidhaa za dawa zinaweza kuuzwa tu kutoka majengo yaliyosajiliwa yenye kibali, na kila duka la rejareja la dawa lazima liendeshwe na mfamasia mkuu aliyesajiliwa", "took over the control of cosmetics and food products from 1 July 2019 and certifies their quality and safety": "ilichukua udhibiti wa vipodozi na bidhaa za chakula kuanzia 1 Julai 2019 na huthibitisha ubora na usalama wake"});

